  {"slug":"bijagos","banner":"images/banners/bijagos.png","color":"oklch(0.64 0.15 60)","region":{"es":"África","en":"Africa","de":"Afrika"},"place":{"es":"Bubaque","en":"Bubaque","de":"Bubaque"},"country":{"es":"Guinea-Bisáu","en":"Guinea-Bissau","de":"Guinea-Bissau"},"dates":{"es":"Feb 2027, días antes del carnaval de Bisáu (por confirmar)","en":"Feb 2027, a few days before the Bissau carnival (tbc)","de":"Feb. 2027, einige Tage vor dem Karneval von Bissau (noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Bubaque, Archipiélago de las Bijagós, Bolama, Guinea-Bisáu, África","en":"Bubaque, Bijagós Archipelago, Bolama, Guinea-Bissau, Africa","de":"Bubaque, Bijagós-Archipel, Bolama, Guinea-Bissau, Afrika"},"origin":{"es":"Danzas rituales bijagó de raíz precolonial; carnaval nacional tras la independencia (1973–74)","en":"Bijagó ritual dances of precolonial roots; national carnival after independence (1973–74)","de":"Rituelle Bijagó-Tänze vorkolonialer Herkunft; nationaler Karneval nach der Unabhängigkeit (1973–74)"},"intro":{"es":"En Bubaque, capital del archipiélago, los grupos de jóvenes bijagó desfilan con máscaras de sus animales sagrados —el toro, el hipopótamo, el pez martillo— para ser elegidos como representantes de las islas en el gran desfile de Bisáu. Es un carnaval donde la sociedad matrilineal bijagó se muestra con sus propias danzas de iniciación.","en":"In Bubaque, the archipelago's capital, groups of young Bijagó parade in masks of their sacred animals —the bull, the hippopotamus, the hammerhead shark— to be chosen to represent the islands in the great parade in Bissau. It is a carnival in which matrilineal Bijagó society shows itself through its own initiation dances.","de":"In Bubaque, dem Hauptort des Archipels, ziehen Gruppen junger Bijagó mit Masken ihrer heiligen Tiere – Stier, Flusspferd, Hammerhai – durch den Ort, um als Vertreter der Inseln für den großen Umzug in Bissau ausgewählt zu werden. Ein Karneval, in dem sich die matrilineare Gesellschaft der Bijagó mit ihren eigenen Initiationstänzen zeigt."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Archipiélago Bolama-Bijagós, Reserva de la Biosfera, UNESCO (1996)","en":"Bolama-Bijagós Archipelago, Biosphere Reserve, UNESCO (1996)","de":"Bolama-Bijagós-Archipel, Biosphärenreservat, UNESCO (1996)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Máscaras de toro (vaca-bruto), hipopótamo y tiburón; reinas; grupos de iniciación","en":"Bull (vaca-bruto), hippopotamus and shark masks; queens; initiation groups","de":"Stier- (Vaca-bruto), Flusspferd- und Haimasken; Königinnen; Initiationsgruppen"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Tambores y cantos bijagó, gumbé","en":"Bijagó drums and songs, gumbé","de":"Bijagó-Trommeln und -Gesänge, Gumbé"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfile en la plaza de Bubaque, selección del grupo representativo, viaje al desfile nacional de Bisáu","en":"Parade on Bubaque's square, selection of the representative group, journey to the national parade in Bissau","de":"Umzug auf dem Platz von Bubaque, Auswahl der Vertretergruppe, Fahrt zum nationalen Umzug in Bissau"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Carnaval de las Bijagós","en":"Bijagós Carnival","de":"Karneval der Bijagós"}},
  {"slug":"calabar","banner":"images/banners/calabar.png","color":"oklch(0.64 0.15 60)","region":{"es":"África","en":"Africa","de":"Afrika"},"place":{"es":"Calabar","en":"Calabar","de":"Calabar"},"country":{"es":"Nigeria","en":"Nigeria","de":"Nigeria"},"dates":{"es":"1 — 31 dic 2026; desfiles 26 y 27 dic","en":"Dec 1 — 31, 2026; parades Dec 26 and 27","de":"1.–31. Dez. 2026; Umzüge am 26. und 27. Dez."},"location":{"es":"Calabar, Cross River, Nigeria, África","en":"Calabar, Cross River, Nigeria, Africa","de":"Calabar, Cross River, Nigeria, Afrika"},"origin":{"es":"Creado en 2004 por el gobierno del estado de Cross River","en":"Created in 2004 by the Cross River State government","de":"2004 von der Regierung des Bundesstaats Cross River gegründet"},"intro":{"es":"El Carnaval de Calabar, que se anuncia como «la mayor fiesta callejera de África», ocupa todo diciembre con el Festival de Navidad de Cross River. Su centro son dos días de desfile en los que grandes bandas compiten con trajes, coreografías y carrozas sobre un tema anual, inspiradas en el modelo de Trinidad.","en":"The Calabar Carnival, billed as “Africa's biggest street party”, fills all of December as part of the Cross River Christmas Festival. At its heart are two parade days in which large bands compete with costumes, choreographies and floats on an annual theme, inspired by the Trinidad model.","de":"Der Karneval von Calabar, der sich als „größte Straßenparty Afrikas“ bezeichnet, füllt im Rahmen des Cross River Christmas Festival den ganzen Dezember. Im Mittelpunkt stehen zwei Umzugstage, an denen große Bands nach dem Vorbild Trinidads mit Kostümen, Choreografien und Wagen zu einem Jahresthema gegeneinander antreten."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Bandas Seagull, Bayside, Masta Blasta, Freedom y Passion 4; reinas del carnaval","en":"Seagull, Bayside, Masta Blasta, Freedom and Passion 4 bands; carnival queens","de":"Bands Seagull, Bayside, Masta Blasta, Freedom und Passion 4; Karnevalsköniginnen"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Afrobeats, highlife, percusión efik","en":"Afrobeats, highlife, Efik percussion","de":"Afrobeats, Highlife, Efik-Perkussion"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfile infantil, Gran Desfile del 27 de diciembre, competencia de bandas","en":"Children's parade, Grand Parade on 27 December, band competition","de":"Kinderumzug, Großer Umzug am 27. Dezember, Bandwettbewerb"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"puno","banner":"images/banners/puno.png","color":"var(--purple)","region":{"es":"Andes","en":"Andes","de":"Anden"},"place":{"es":"Puno","en":"Puno","de":"Puno"},"country":{"es":"Perú","en":"Peru","de":"Peru"},"dates":{"es":"1 — 15 feb 2027 (aprox.)","en":"Feb 1 — 15, 2027 (approx.)","de":"1.–15. Feb. 2027 (ca.)"},"location":{"es":"Puno, Departamento de Puno, Perú, América del Sur","en":"Puno, Puno Region, Peru, South America","de":"Puno, Region Puno, Peru, Südamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Época colonial; devoción a la Virgen de la Candelaria desde el siglo XVI","en":"Colonial era; devotion to the Virgen de la Candelaria since the 16th century","de":"Kolonialzeit; Verehrung der Virgen de la Candelaria seit dem 16. Jh."},"intro":{"es":"A orillas del lago Titicaca, la Festividad de la Virgen de la Candelaria coincide con el carnaval y reúne a decenas de miles de danzarines quechuas y aimaras. Durante dos semanas, conjuntos de trajes autóctonos y de luces bailan en el estadio y por las calles de Puno.","en":"On the shores of Lake Titicaca, the Feast of the Virgen de la Candelaria coincides with carnival and brings together tens of thousands of Quechua and Aymara dancers. For two weeks, groups in autochthonous costumes and trajes de luces dance in the stadium and through the streets of Puno.","de":"Am Ufer des Titicacasees fällt das Fest der Virgen de la Candelaria mit dem Karneval zusammen und vereint Zehntausende Quechua- und Aymara-Tänzer. Zwei Wochen lang tanzen Gruppen in autochthonen Trachten und Trajes de luces im Stadion und durch die Straßen von Puno."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Patrimonio Cultural de la Nación, Perú (2003)","en":"National Cultural Heritage, Peru (2003)","de":"Nationales Kulturerbe, Peru (2003)"},{"es":"Festividad de la Virgen de la Candelaria de Puno, Lista Representativa del Patrimonio Cultural Inmaterial, UNESCO (2014)","en":"Festivity of Virgen de la Candelaria of Puno, Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage, UNESCO (2014)","de":"Fest der Virgen de la Candelaria von Puno, Repräsentative Liste des immateriellen Kulturerbes, UNESCO (2014)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Diablos, morenos, kullawas, llameros, sikuris, waca wacas","en":"Devils, morenos, kullawas, llameros, sikuris, waca wacas","de":"Teufel, Morenos, Kullawas, Llameros, Sikuris, Waca Wacas"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Sikuri, bandas de bronce, diablada, morenada, kullawada","en":"Sikuri, brass bands, diablada, morenada, kullawada","de":"Sikuri, Blaskapellen, Diablada, Morenada, Kullawada"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Concurso de danzas autóctonas, Parada de veneración con trajes de luces, procesión de la Virgen","en":"Contest of autochthonous dances, Parade of veneration in trajes de luces, procession of the Virgin","de":"Wettbewerb autochthoner Tänze, Verehrungsparade in Trajes de luces, Prozession der Jungfrau"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Fiesta de la Candelaria","en":"Feast of the Candelaria","de":"Fest der Candelaria"}},
  {"slug":"tilcara","banner":"images/banners/tilcara.png","color":"var(--purple)","region":{"es":"Andes","en":"Andes","de":"Anden"},"place":{"es":"Tilcara","en":"Tilcara","de":"Tilcara"},"country":{"es":"Argentina","en":"Argentina","de":"Argentinien"},"dates":{"es":"6 — 14 feb 2027","en":"Feb 6 — 14, 2027","de":"6.–14. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Tilcara, Quebrada de Humahuaca, Jujuy, Argentina, América del Sur","en":"Tilcara, Quebrada de Humahuaca, Jujuy, Argentina, South America","de":"Tilcara, Quebrada de Humahuaca, Jujuy, Argentinien, Südamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Raíces andinas prehispánicas (anata, ritos de cosecha) y carnaval colonial","en":"Pre-Hispanic Andean roots (anata, harvest rites) and colonial carnival","de":"Vorspanische andine Wurzeln (Anata, Ernteriten) und kolonialer Karneval"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de la Quebrada empieza con el desentierro del diablo, el Pujllay, que se saca de su mojón de piedras en el cerro. Durante ocho días, las comparsas recorren Tilcara con albahaca, harina, serpentinas y coplas cantadas con caja, hasta que el domingo de tentación se vuelve a enterrar al diablo.","en":"The carnival of the Quebrada begins with the unearthing of the devil, the Pujllay, taken out of his stone mound on the hillside. For eight days, comparsas roam Tilcara with basil, flour, streamers and coplas sung with the caja drum, until the devil is buried again on Temptation Sunday.","de":"Der Karneval der Quebrada beginnt mit der Ausgrabung des Teufels, des Pujllay, aus seinem Steinhügel am Berghang. Acht Tage lang ziehen Comparsas mit Basilikum, Mehl, Luftschlangen und zur Caja gesungenen Coplas durch Tilcara, bis der Teufel am Versuchungssonntag wieder begraben wird."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Quebrada de Humahuaca, Patrimonio de la Humanidad, UNESCO (2003)","en":"Quebrada de Humahuaca, World Heritage Site, UNESCO (2003)","de":"Quebrada de Humahuaca, Welterbe, UNESCO (2003)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Pujllay (el diablo), diablitos, comparsas, copleros","en":"Pujllay (the devil), little devils, comparsas, copla singers","de":"Pujllay (der Teufel), Teufelchen, Comparsas, Coplasänger"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Coplas con caja, erke, anata, bandas de sikus, cumbia norteña","en":"Coplas with caja, erke, anata, siku bands, northern cumbia","de":"Coplas mit Caja, Erke, Anata, Siku-Bands, Cumbia norteña"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desentierro del diablo, ofrenda a la Pachamama, entierro el domingo de tentación","en":"Unearthing of the devil, offering to Pachamama, burial on Temptation Sunday","de":"Ausgrabung des Teufels, Opfergabe an Pachamama, Begräbnis am Versuchungssonntag"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Carnaval de la Quebrada","en":"Carnival of the Quebrada","de":"Karneval der Quebrada"}},
  {"slug":"providencia","banner":"images/banners/providencia.png","color":"var(--coral)","region":{"es":"Gran Caribe","en":"Greater Caribbean","de":"Großkaribik"},"place":{"es":"Providencia","en":"Providencia","de":"Providencia"},"country":{"es":"Colombia","en":"Colombia","de":"Kolumbien"},"dates":{"es":"Junio 2027 (por confirmar)","en":"June 2027 (tbc)","de":"Juni 2027 (noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Isla de Providencia, San Andrés, Providencia y Santa Catalina, Colombia, América (Caribe)","en":"Providencia Island, San Andrés, Providencia and Santa Catalina, Colombia, Americas (Caribbean)","de":"Insel Providencia, San Andrés, Providencia und Santa Catalina, Kolumbien, Amerika (Karibik)"},"origin":{"es":"Origen incierto; oficializado en 1973 como Festival de la Vieja Providencia","en":"Uncertain origins; made official in 1973 as the Old Providence Festival","de":"Ungewisser Ursprung; 1973 als Festival von Old Providence offiziell eingeführt"},"intro":{"es":"En la isla de Providencia, de habla creole, el carnaval conmemora la adhesión del archipiélago a la Gran Colombia en 1822. Desde 1973 se celebra como Festival Folclórico, Cultural y Deportivo de la Vieja Providencia, con reinado, comparsas por sectores, música isleña y carreras de caballos en la playa.","en":"On the Creole-speaking island of Providencia, carnival commemorates the archipelago's accession to Gran Colombia in 1822. Since 1973 it has been held as the Folkloric, Cultural and Sports Festival of Old Providence, with a pageant, comparsas from each sector, island music and horse races on the beach.","de":"Auf der kreolischsprachigen Insel Providencia erinnert der Karneval an den Beitritt des Archipels zu Großkolumbien 1822. Seit 1973 wird er als Folklore-, Kultur- und Sportfestival von Old Providence gefeiert – mit Schönheitswahl, Comparsas der Ortsteile, Inselmusik und Pferderennen am Strand."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Seaflower, Reserva de la Biosfera, UNESCO (2000)","en":"Seaflower, Biosphere Reserve, UNESCO (2000)","de":"Seaflower, Biosphärenreservat, UNESCO (2000)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Reinas de los sectores (Old Town, Santa Catalina, La Montaña), comparsas","en":"Sector queens (Old Town, Santa Catalina, La Montaña), comparsas","de":"Königinnen der Ortsteile (Old Town, Santa Catalina, La Montaña), Comparsas"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Calipso, mento, schottische, polka isleña, reggae","en":"Calypso, mento, schottische, island polka, reggae","de":"Calypso, Mento, Schottische, Inselpolka, Reggae"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfile de comparsas, reinado, carreras de caballos en Southwest Bay","en":"Comparsa parade, pageant, horse races at Southwest Bay","de":"Comparsa-Umzug, Schönheitswahl, Pferderennen in Southwest Bay"}}],"related":[{"type":{"es":"Especial","en":"Special","de":"Spezial"},"href":"especial-calypso.html","img":"images/calypso-card.png","title":{"es":"La ruta del calipso","en":"The Calypso Route","de":"Die Route des Calypso"},"deck":{"es":"Historia, monarcas, géneros hermanos y rutas de migración, en ocho capítulos.","en":"History, monarchs, sister genres and migration routes, in eight chapters.","de":"Geschichte, Monarchen, verwandte Genres und Migrationsrouten in acht Kapiteln."}}],"alias":{"es":"Festival de la Vieja Providencia","en":"Old Providence Festival","de":"Festival von Old Providence"}},
  {"slug":"riosucio","banner":"images/banners/riosucio.png","color":"var(--purple)","region":{"es":"Andes","en":"Andes","de":"Anden"},"place":{"es":"Riosucio","en":"Riosucio","de":"Riosucio"},"country":{"es":"Colombia","en":"Colombia","de":"Kolumbien"},"dates":{"es":"Ene 2027 (bienal; fechas por confirmar)","en":"Jan 2027 (biennial; dates tbc)","de":"Jan. 2027 (alle zwei Jahre; Termine noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Riosucio, Caldas, Colombia, América del Sur","en":"Riosucio, Caldas, Colombia, South America","de":"Riosucio, Caldas, Kolumbien, Südamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Fiestas de Reyes desde 1847; Carnaval del Diablo desde 1915","en":"Epiphany festivities since 1847; Carnival of the Devil since 1915","de":"Dreikönigsfeste seit 1847; Teufelskarneval seit 1915"},"intro":{"es":"Cada dos años, en enero, Riosucio celebra al Diablo como símbolo de la reconciliación entre los antiguos pueblos de Quiebralomo y La Montaña. Las cuadrillas recitan versos satíricos, los decretos del carnaval se leen en la plaza y una gran efigie del Diablo preside la fiesta hasta que se quema al final.","en":"Every two years, in January, Riosucio celebrates the Devil as a symbol of reconciliation between the old towns of Quiebralomo and La Montaña. The cuadrillas recite satirical verses, the carnival decrees are read on the square and a great effigy of the Devil presides over the festival until it is burned at the end.","de":"Alle zwei Jahre im Januar feiert Riosucio den Teufel als Symbol der Versöhnung zwischen den alten Orten Quiebralomo und La Montaña. Die Cuadrillas tragen satirische Verse vor, die Karnevalsdekrete werden auf dem Platz verlesen, und eine große Teufelsfigur steht über dem Fest, bis sie am Ende verbrannt wird."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Declaratoria nacional por verificar","en":"National designation to be verified","de":"Nationale Auszeichnung noch zu prüfen"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"El Diablo, matachines, cuadrillas, Republicanos","en":"The Devil, matachines, cuadrillas, Republicanos","de":"Der Teufel, Matachines, Cuadrillas, Republicanos"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Música de cuadrillas, bambuco, pasillo, chirimía","en":"Cuadrilla music, bambuco, pasillo, chirimía","de":"Cuadrilla-Musik, Bambuco, Pasillo, Chirimía"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Decretos, entrada del Diablo, desfile de cuadrillas, testamento y quema del Diablo","en":"Decrees, entry of the Devil, cuadrilla parade, testament and burning of the Devil","de":"Dekrete, Einzug des Teufels, Cuadrilla-Umzug, Testament und Verbrennung des Teufels"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Carnaval del Diablo","en":"Carnival of the Devil","de":"Teufelskarneval"}},
  {"slug":"cayena","banner":"images/banners/cayena.png","color":"var(--coral)","region":{"es":"Gran Caribe","en":"Greater Caribbean","de":"Großkaribik"},"place":{"es":"Cayena","en":"Cayenne","de":"Cayenne"},"country":{"es":"Guayana Francesa","en":"French Guiana","de":"Französisch-Guayana"},"dates":{"es":"6 ene — 10 feb 2027","en":"Jan 6 — Feb 10, 2027","de":"6. Jan. – 10. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Cayena, Guayana Francesa, América del Sur","en":"Cayenne, French Guiana, South America","de":"Cayenne, Französisch-Guayana, Südamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Carnaval criollo del siglo XIX, tras la abolición de la esclavitud (1848)","en":"19th-century Creole carnival, after the abolition of slavery (1848)","de":"Kreolischer Karneval des 19. Jh., nach der Abschaffung der Sklaverei (1848)"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Guayana va de la Epifanía al Miércoles de Ceniza. Los domingos, los grupos desfilan por las calles de Cayena; las noches de sábado pertenecen a las touloulous, mujeres enmascaradas de pies a cabeza que eligen a su pareja de baile. Termina con la quema de Vaval, el rey del carnaval.","en":"The Guianese carnival runs from Epiphany to Ash Wednesday. On Sundays, groups parade through the streets of Cayenne; Saturday nights belong to the touloulous, women masked from head to toe who choose their dance partners. It ends with the burning of Vaval, the king of carnival.","de":"Der Karneval von Guayana dauert von Dreikönig bis Aschermittwoch. Sonntags ziehen Gruppen durch die Straßen von Cayenne; die Samstagnächte gehören den Touloulous, von Kopf bis Fuß maskierten Frauen, die ihre Tanzpartner wählen. Er endet mit der Verbrennung von Vaval, dem Karnevalskönig."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Touloulous, Vaval, diablos rojos, Neg Marron, Karolin","en":"Touloulous, Vaval, red devils, Neg Marron, Karolin","de":"Touloulous, Vaval, rote Teufel, Neg Marron, Karolin"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Grupos a pie con metales y percusión, kasékò, biguine","en":"Groupes à pied with brass and percussion, kasékò, biguine","de":"Groupes à pied mit Bläsern und Perkussion, Kasékò, Biguine"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfiles dominicales, bailes de touloulous, Martes de Carnaval en rojo y negro, quema de Vaval","en":"Sunday parades, touloulou balls, Shrove Tuesday in red and black, burning of Vaval","de":"Sonntagsumzüge, Touloulou-Bälle, Fastnachtsdienstag in Rot und Schwarz, Verbrennung von Vaval"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Carnaval de Guayana","en":"Guianese Carnival","de":"Karneval von Guayana"}},
  {"slug":"kandy","banner":"images/banners/kandy.png","color":"oklch(0.55 0.17 20)","region":{"es":"Asia","en":"Asia","de":"Asien"},"place":{"es":"Kandy","en":"Kandy","de":"Kandy"},"country":{"es":"Sri Lanka","en":"Sri Lanka","de":"Sri Lanka"},"dates":{"es":"Jul — ago 2027 (según la luna llena de Esala)","en":"Jul — Aug 2027 (by the Esala full moon)","de":"Juli – Aug. 2027 (nach dem Esala-Vollmond)"},"location":{"es":"Kandy, Provincia Central, Sri Lanka, Asia","en":"Kandy, Central Province, Sri Lanka, Asia","de":"Kandy, Zentralprovinz, Sri Lanka, Asien"},"origin":{"es":"Procesión de la Reliquia del Diente desde el siglo IV; forma actual desde 1775","en":"Procession of the Tooth Relic since the 4th century; present form since 1775","de":"Prozession der Zahnreliquie seit dem 4. Jh.; heutige Form seit 1775"},"intro":{"es":"La Esala Perahera recorre durante diez noches las calles de Kandy en honor a la Reliquia del Diente de Buda. Elefantes engalanados, tamborileros, danzantes kandyanos, portadores de antorchas y látigos forman una procesión que une el budismo con el culto a los dioses protectores de la isla.","en":"For ten nights, the Esala Perahera winds through the streets of Kandy in honour of the Buddha's Tooth Relic. Caparisoned elephants, drummers, Kandyan dancers, torch-bearers and whip-crackers form a procession that unites Buddhism with the worship of the island's guardian deities.","de":"Zehn Nächte lang zieht die Esala Perahera zu Ehren der Zahnreliquie Buddhas durch die Straßen von Kandy. Geschmückte Elefanten, Trommler, Kandy-Tänzer, Fackelträger und Peitschenknaller bilden eine Prozession, die den Buddhismus mit der Verehrung der Schutzgötter der Insel verbindet."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Ciudad sagrada de Kandy, Patrimonio de la Humanidad, UNESCO (1988)","en":"Sacred City of Kandy, World Heritage Site, UNESCO (1988)","de":"Heilige Stadt Kandy, Welterbe, UNESCO (1988)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Elefante del Maligawa (portador del relicario), danzantes kandyanos, Nilame","en":"Maligawa elephant (casket bearer), Kandyan dancers, Nilame","de":"Maligawa-Elefant (Reliquienträger), Kandy-Tänzer, Nilame"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Tambores geta bera y davul, danza ves","en":"Geta bera and davul drums, ves dance","de":"Geta-Bera- und Davul-Trommeln, Ves-Tanz"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Kumbal Perahera, Randoli Perahera, Diya Kepeema (corte del agua)","en":"Kumbal Perahera, Randoli Perahera, Diya Kepeema (water-cutting)","de":"Kumbal Perahera, Randoli Perahera, Diya Kepeema (Wasserschneiden)"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Esala Perahera","en":"Esala Perahera","de":"Esala Perahera"}},
  {"slug":"surakarta","banner":"images/banners/surakarta.png","color":"oklch(0.55 0.17 20)","region":{"es":"Asia","en":"Asia","de":"Asien"},"place":{"es":"Surakarta","en":"Surakarta","de":"Surakarta"},"country":{"es":"Indonesia","en":"Indonesia","de":"Indonesien"},"dates":{"es":"2027, fecha por confirmar (habitualmente a mitad de año)","en":"2027, date tbc (usually mid-year)","de":"2027, Termin noch offen (meist zur Jahresmitte)"},"location":{"es":"Surakarta (Solo), Java Central, Indonesia, Asia","en":"Surakarta (Solo), Central Java, Indonesia, Asia","de":"Surakarta (Solo), Zentraljava, Indonesien, Asien"},"origin":{"es":"Solo Batik Carnival desde 2008","en":"Solo Batik Carnival since 2008","de":"Solo Batik Carnival seit 2008"},"intro":{"es":"El Solo Batik Carnival convierte la tradición textil de Surakarta, antigua corte real javanesa, en un desfile de trajes monumentales hechos con batik. Cada edición propone un tema y cientos de participantes de la ciudad diseñan y cosen sus vestuarios en talleres comunitarios.","en":"The Solo Batik Carnival turns the textile tradition of Surakarta, an old Javanese royal court, into a parade of monumental costumes made of batik. Each edition sets a theme, and hundreds of local participants design and sew their outfits in community workshops.","de":"Der Solo Batik Carnival verwandelt die Textiltradition von Surakarta, einem alten javanischen Königshof, in einen Umzug monumentaler Kostüme aus Batik. Jede Ausgabe hat ein Thema, und Hunderte Teilnehmende aus der Stadt entwerfen und nähen ihre Kostüme in Gemeinschaftswerkstätten."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Batik indonesio, Lista Representativa del Patrimonio Cultural Inmaterial, UNESCO (2009)","en":"Indonesian batik, Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage, UNESCO (2009)","de":"Indonesischer Batik, Repräsentative Liste des immateriellen Kulturerbes, UNESCO (2009)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Trajes de batik, alas y tocados monumentales, kraton (corte real)","en":"Batik costumes, monumental wings and headdresses, kraton (royal court)","de":"Batik-Kostüme, monumentale Flügel und Kopfputze, Kraton (Königshof)"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Gamelán, keroncong","en":"Gamelan, keroncong","de":"Gamelan, Keroncong"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfile por la calle Slamet Riyadi, talleres de vestuario","en":"Parade along Jalan Slamet Riyadi, costume workshops","de":"Umzug über die Jalan Slamet Riyadi, Kostümwerkstätten"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Solo Batik Carnival","en":"Solo Batik Carnival","de":"Solo Batik Carnival"}},
  {"slug":"ivrea","banner":"images/banners/ivrea.png","color":"var(--teal)","region":{"es":"Europa mediterránea","en":"Mediterranean Europe","de":"Mittelmeer-Europa"},"place":{"es":"Ivrea","en":"Ivrea","de":"Ivrea"},"country":{"es":"Italia","en":"Italy","de":"Italien"},"dates":{"es":"6 — 10 feb 2027","en":"Feb 6 — 10, 2027","de":"6.–10. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Ivrea, Piamonte, Italia, Europa","en":"Ivrea, Piedmont, Italy, Europe","de":"Ivrea, Piemont, Italien, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Carnaval de barrios medieval; reglamentado en 1808; batalla de naranjas desde mediados del siglo XIX","en":"Medieval neighbourhood carnival; regulated in 1808; battle of oranges since the mid-19th century","de":"Mittelalterlicher Viertelkarneval; 1808 geregelt; Orangenschlacht seit Mitte des 19. Jh."},"intro":{"es":"El Storico Carnevale di Ivrea recuerda la rebelión de la ciudad contra un tirano medieval, encarnada en la Mugnaia, la molinera. Su momento más célebre es la batalla de las naranjas: los aranceri a pie, que representan al pueblo, se enfrentan en las plazas a los carros de los tiranos.","en":"The Storico Carnevale di Ivrea recalls the city's uprising against a medieval tyrant, embodied by the Mugnaia, the miller's daughter. Its most famous moment is the battle of oranges: the orange-throwers on foot, representing the people, face the tyrants' carts in the squares.","de":"Der Storico Carnevale di Ivrea erinnert an den Aufstand der Stadt gegen einen mittelalterlichen Tyrannen, verkörpert durch die Mugnaia, die Müllerin. Berühmtester Moment ist die Orangenschlacht: Die Aranceri zu Fuß, die das Volk darstellen, treten auf den Plätzen gegen die Wagen der Tyrannen an."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"La Mugnaia, el General, aranceri, abbà, berretto frigio","en":"The Mugnaia, the General, aranceri, abbà, Phrygian cap","de":"Die Mugnaia, der General, Aranceri, Abbà, Phrygische Mütze"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Pífanos y tambores, banda municipal","en":"Fifes and drums, civic band","de":"Pfeifen und Trommeln, Stadtkapelle"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Aparición de la Mugnaia, batalla de las naranjas, quema de los scarli","en":"Appearance of the Mugnaia, battle of oranges, burning of the scarli","de":"Erscheinen der Mugnaia, Orangenschlacht, Verbrennung der Scarli"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Storico Carnevale di Ivrea","en":"Historic Carnival of Ivrea","de":"Historischer Karneval von Ivrea"}},
  {"slug":"mohacs","banner":"images/banners/mohacs.png","color":"var(--green)","region":{"es":"Europa central","en":"Central Europe","de":"Mitteleuropa"},"place":{"es":"Mohács","en":"Mohács","de":"Mohács"},"country":{"es":"Hungría","en":"Hungary","de":"Ungarn"},"dates":{"es":"4 — 9 feb 2027","en":"Feb 4 — 9, 2027","de":"4.–9. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Mohács, Baranya, Hungría, Europa","en":"Mohács, Baranya, Hungary, Europe","de":"Mohács, Baranya, Ungarn, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Tradición de los šokci (croatas del Danubio) documentada desde el siglo XVIII","en":"Tradition of the Šokci (Danube Croats) documented since the 18th century","de":"Tradition der Schokatzen (Donaukroaten), seit dem 18. Jh. belegt"},"intro":{"es":"En el Busójárás, los busós, hombres con máscaras de madera talladas, cuernos y abrigos de piel de oveja, cruzan el Danubio en barcas y toman Mohács con cencerros y matracas para espantar el invierno. La fiesta culmina con una gran hoguera en la plaza mayor.","en":"In the Busójárás, the busós —men in carved wooden masks, horns and sheepskin cloaks— cross the Danube in boats and take Mohács with cowbells and rattles to chase away the winter. The festival culminates in a great bonfire on the main square.","de":"Beim Busójárás überqueren die Busós – Männer mit geschnitzten Holzmasken, Hörnern und Schaffellmänteln – in Booten die Donau und nehmen Mohács mit Kuhglocken und Ratschen ein, um den Winter zu vertreiben. Das Fest gipfelt in einem großen Feuer auf dem Hauptplatz."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Busójárás en Mohács, Lista Representativa del Patrimonio Cultural Inmaterial, UNESCO (2009)","en":"Busó festivities at Mohács, Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage, UNESCO (2009)","de":"Busójárás in Mohács, Repräsentative Liste des immateriellen Kulturerbes, UNESCO (2009)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Busós, jankelek, ataúd del invierno","en":"Busós, jankelek, coffin of winter","de":"Busós, Jankelek, Sarg des Winters"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Cencerros, matracas, música tradicional šokac (tamburica)","en":"Cowbells, rattles, traditional Šokac music (tamburica)","de":"Kuhglocken, Ratschen, traditionelle Schokatzenmusik (Tamburica)"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Cruce del Danubio, desfile de los busós, hoguera del domingo","en":"Danube crossing, busó parade, Sunday bonfire","de":"Donauüberquerung, Busó-Umzug, Sonntagsfeuer"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Busójárás","en":"Busójárás","de":"Busójárás"}},
  {"slug":"viareggio","banner":"images/banners/viareggio.png","color":"var(--teal)","region":{"es":"Europa mediterránea","en":"Mediterranean Europe","de":"Mittelmeer-Europa"},"place":{"es":"Viareggio","en":"Viareggio","de":"Viareggio"},"country":{"es":"Italia","en":"Italy","de":"Italien"},"dates":{"es":"Ene — feb 2027 (desfiles en fines de semana)","en":"Jan — Feb 2027 (weekend parades)","de":"Jan. – Feb. 2027 (Umzüge an Wochenenden)"},"location":{"es":"Viareggio, Toscana, Italia, Europa","en":"Viareggio, Tuscany, Italy, Europe","de":"Viareggio, Toskana, Italien, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Primer desfile en 1873; carrozas de cartapesta desde 1925","en":"First parade in 1873; papier-mâché floats since 1925","de":"Erster Umzug 1873; Pappmaché-Wagen seit 1925"},"intro":{"es":"El Carnevale di Viareggio es célebre por sus carrozas alegóricas de cartapesta, de hasta veinte metros de alto, que caricaturizan a políticos y celebridades. Se construyen durante todo el año en la Cittadella del Carnevale y desfilan frente al mar por los paseos de la ciudad.","en":"The Carnevale di Viareggio is famous for its allegorical papier-mâché floats, up to twenty metres tall, that caricature politicians and celebrities. They are built all year in the Cittadella del Carnevale and parade along the city's seafront promenades.","de":"Der Carnevale di Viareggio ist berühmt für seine allegorischen Pappmaché-Wagen von bis zu zwanzig Metern Höhe, die Politiker und Prominente karikieren. Sie werden das ganze Jahr in der Cittadella del Carnevale gebaut und ziehen über die Strandpromenaden der Stadt."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Burlamacco y Ondina, carristi (constructores de carrozas)","en":"Burlamacco and Ondina, carristi (float builders)","de":"Burlamacco und Ondina, Carristi (Wagenbauer)"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Canciones del carnaval de Viareggio, bandas","en":"Viareggio carnival songs, bands","de":"Karnevalslieder von Viareggio, Kapellen"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Corsi mascherati en los viali a mare, premiación de las carrozas, fuegos artificiales","en":"Masked parades on the viali a mare, float awards, fireworks","de":"Maskenumzüge auf den Viali a mare, Preisverleihung der Wagen, Feuerwerk"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Carnevale di Viareggio","en":"Viareggio Carnival","de":"Karneval von Viareggio"}},
  {"slug":"dunkerque","banner":"images/banners/dunkerque.png","color":"var(--green)","region":{"es":"Europa central","en":"Central Europe","de":"Mitteleuropa"},"place":{"es":"Dunkerque","en":"Dunkirk","de":"Dünkirchen"},"country":{"es":"Francia","en":"France","de":"Frankreich"},"dates":{"es":"Ene — mar 2027; Trois Joyeuses 7 — 9 feb","en":"Jan — Mar 2027; Trois Joyeuses Feb 7 — 9","de":"Jan. – März 2027; Trois Joyeuses 7.–9. Feb."},"location":{"es":"Dunkerque, Norte, Altos de Francia, Francia, Europa","en":"Dunkirk, Nord, Hauts-de-France, France, Europe","de":"Dünkirchen, Nord, Hauts-de-France, Frankreich, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Siglo XVII; fiesta de despedida de los pescadores que partían a Islandia","en":"17th century; farewell feast for fishermen leaving for Iceland","de":"17. Jh.; Abschiedsfest der nach Island aufbrechenden Fischer"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Dunkerque nació como la última fiesta de los pescadores antes de zarpar hacia Islandia. Hoy, las bandas recorren la ciudad tras el tambor mayor, disfrazadas con ropa prestada, sombrillas y pelucas, y en el chahut se empujan cantando; desde el balcón del ayuntamiento se lanzan arenques ahumados.","en":"The Dunkirk carnival began as the fishermen's last feast before sailing to Iceland. Today the bands march through the city behind the drum major, disguised in borrowed clothes, umbrellas and wigs, pushing and singing in the chahut; smoked herrings are thrown from the town-hall balcony.","de":"Der Karneval von Dünkirchen entstand als letztes Fest der Fischer vor der Fahrt nach Island. Heute ziehen die Bandes hinter dem Tambourmajor durch die Stadt, verkleidet mit geliehenen Kleidern, Schirmen und Perücken, und drängen singend im Chahut; vom Rathausbalkon werden Räucherheringe geworfen."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Tambor mayor, clet'ches, masquelours, Reuze (gigante)","en":"Drum major, clet'ches, masquelours, Reuze (giant)","de":"Tambourmajor, Clet'ches, Masquelours, Reuze (Riese)"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Fifres y tambores, Cantate à Jean Bart, canciones en flamenco y francés","en":"Fifes and drums, Cantate à Jean Bart, songs in Flemish and French","de":"Pfeifen und Trommeln, Cantate à Jean Bart, Lieder auf Flämisch und Französisch"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Bandes, chahut, rigodon final en la plaza Jean Bart, lanzamiento de arenques","en":"Bandes, chahut, final rigodon on Place Jean Bart, herring throw","de":"Bandes, Chahut, Abschlussrigodon auf der Place Jean Bart, Heringswurf"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Carnaval de Dunkerque","en":"Dunkirk Carnival","de":"Karneval von Dünkirchen"}},
  {"slug":"notting-hill","banner":"images/banners/notting-hill.png","color":"var(--coral)","region":{"es":"Gran Caribe","en":"Greater Caribbean","de":"Großkaribik"},"place":{"es":"Notting Hill","en":"Notting Hill","de":"Notting Hill"},"country":{"es":"Reino Unido","en":"United Kingdom","de":"Vereinigtes Königreich"},"dates":{"es":"29 — 30 ago 2027","en":"Aug 29 — 30, 2027","de":"29.–30. Aug. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Notting Hill, Londres, Inglaterra, Reino Unido, Europa","en":"Notting Hill, London, England, United Kingdom, Europe","de":"Notting Hill, London, England, Vereinigtes Königreich, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Carnaval caribeño de Claudia Jones (1959); fiesta de calle de Notting Hill desde 1966","en":"Claudia Jones's Caribbean carnival (1959); Notting Hill street festival since 1966","de":"Karibischer Karneval von Claudia Jones (1959); Straßenfest in Notting Hill seit 1966"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Notting Hill es la gran fiesta de la diáspora caribeña en Europa. Nació como respuesta comunitaria a los disturbios raciales de 1958 y hoy, el fin de semana festivo de agosto, llena el oeste de Londres de bandas de mas, steelbands y sistemas de sonido.","en":"The Notting Hill Carnival is the great festival of the Caribbean diaspora in Europe. Born as a community response to the 1958 race riots, it now fills West London on the August bank holiday weekend with mas bands, steelbands and sound systems.","de":"Der Notting Hill Carnival ist das große Fest der karibischen Diaspora in Europa. Entstanden als Antwort der Community auf die rassistischen Ausschreitungen von 1958, füllt er heute am Feiertagswochenende im August West-London mit Mas-Bands, Steelbands und Soundsystems."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Bandas de mas, steelbands, sistemas de sonido","en":"Mas bands, steelbands, sound systems","de":"Mas-Bands, Steelbands, Soundsystems"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Soca, calipso, steelpan, reggae, dancehall","en":"Soca, calypso, steelpan, reggae, dancehall","de":"Soca, Calypso, Steelpan, Reggae, Dancehall"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Panorama, J'ouvert, Día de los Niños (domingo), Gran Desfile (lunes)","en":"Panorama, J'ouvert, Children's Day (Sunday), Grand Parade (Monday)","de":"Panorama, J'ouvert, Kindertag (Sonntag), Große Parade (Montag)"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Notting Hill Carnival","en":"Notting Hill Carnival","de":"Notting Hill Carnival"}},
  {"slug":"jacmel","banner":"images/banners/jacmel.png","color":"var(--coral)","region":{"es":"Gran Caribe","en":"Greater Caribbean","de":"Großkaribik"},"place":{"es":"Jacmel","en":"Jacmel","de":"Jacmel"},"country":{"es":"Haití","en":"Haiti","de":"Haiti"},"dates":{"es":"Feb 2027 (por confirmar)","en":"Feb 2027 (tbc)","de":"Feb. 2027 (noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Jacmel, Sudeste, Haití, América (Caribe)","en":"Jacmel, Sud-Est, Haiti, Americas (Caribbean)","de":"Jacmel, Sud-Est, Haiti, Amerika (Karibik)"},"origin":{"es":"Carnaval criollo del siglo XIX","en":"19th-century Creole carnival","de":"Kreolischer Karneval des 19. Jh."},"intro":{"es":"Jacmel es la ciudad de las máscaras de papel maché. Sus artesanos preparan durante meses figuras de animales, diablos y personajes de la historia haitiana, que desfilan por las calles junto a grupos de rara y teatro callejero. Es el carnaval más artesanal de Haití.","en":"Jacmel is the city of papier-mâché masks. Its artisans spend months preparing figures of animals, devils and characters from Haitian history, which parade through the streets alongside rara bands and street theatre. It is Haiti's most handcrafted carnival.","de":"Jacmel ist die Stadt der Pappmaché-Masken. Monatelang fertigen ihre Kunsthandwerker Tiere, Teufel und Figuren der haitianischen Geschichte, die mit Rara-Gruppen und Straßentheater durch die Straßen ziehen. Es ist der handwerklichste Karneval Haitis."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Máscaras de papel maché, Chaloska, Zèl Maturin, Lanceurs de corde","en":"Papier-mâché masks, Chaloska, Zèl Maturin, Lanceurs de corde","de":"Pappmaché-Masken, Chaloska, Zèl Maturin, Lanceurs de corde"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Rara, kompa, tambores","en":"Rara, kompa, drums","de":"Rara, Kompa, Trommeln"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfile de máscaras por el centro histórico","en":"Mask parade through the historic centre","de":"Maskenumzug durch die Altstadt"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"bridgetown","banner":"images/banners/bridgetown.png","color":"var(--coral)","region":{"es":"Gran Caribe","en":"Greater Caribbean","de":"Großkaribik"},"place":{"es":"Bridgetown","en":"Bridgetown","de":"Bridgetown"},"country":{"es":"Barbados","en":"Barbados","de":"Barbados"},"dates":{"es":"Jul — ago 2027; Grand Kadooment 2 ago","en":"Jul — Aug 2027; Grand Kadooment Aug 2","de":"Juli – Aug. 2027; Grand Kadooment 2. Aug."},"location":{"es":"Bridgetown, Barbados, América (Caribe)","en":"Bridgetown, Barbados, Americas (Caribbean)","de":"Bridgetown, Barbados, Amerika (Karibik)"},"origin":{"es":"Fiesta de fin de la zafra de azúcar (siglo XVIII); relanzado en 1974","en":"End of sugar-cane harvest festival (18th c.); relaunched in 1974","de":"Fest zum Ende der Zuckerrohrernte (18. Jh.); 1974 wiederbelebt"},"intro":{"es":"Crop Over nació como la celebración del fin de la cosecha de caña en las plantaciones. Relanzado en 1974, hoy ocupa todo el verano con competencias de calipso y soca, el Foreday Morning Jam y el gran desfile de bandas de mas del Grand Kadooment.","en":"Crop Over began as the celebration of the end of the cane harvest on the plantations. Relaunched in 1974, it now fills the whole summer with calypso and soca competitions, the Foreday Morning Jam and the great mas band parade of Grand Kadooment.","de":"Crop Over entstand als Fest zum Ende der Zuckerrohrernte auf den Plantagen. 1974 wiederbelebt, füllt es heute den ganzen Sommer mit Calypso- und Soca-Wettbewerben, dem Foreday Morning Jam und der großen Mas-Band-Parade des Grand Kadooment."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Bandas de mas, Mr. Harding, calipsonianos","en":"Mas bands, Mr. Harding, calypsonians","de":"Mas-Bands, Mr. Harding, Calypsonians"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Calipso, soca, spouge, tuk","en":"Calypso, soca, spouge, tuk","de":"Calypso, Soca, Spouge, Tuk"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Pic-O-De-Crop, Foreday Morning Jam, Grand Kadooment","en":"Pic-O-De-Crop, Foreday Morning Jam, Grand Kadooment","de":"Pic-O-De-Crop, Foreday Morning Jam, Grand Kadooment"}}],"related":[{"type":{"es":"Especial","en":"Special","de":"Spezial"},"href":"especial-calypso.html","img":"images/calypso-card.png","title":{"es":"La ruta del calipso","en":"The Calypso Route","de":"Die Route des Calypso"},"deck":{"es":"Historia, monarcas, géneros hermanos y rutas de migración, en ocho capítulos.","en":"History, monarchs, sister genres and migration routes, in eight chapters.","de":"Geschichte, Monarchen, verwandte Genres und Migrationsrouten in acht Kapiteln."}}],"alias":{"es":"Crop Over","en":"Crop Over","de":"Crop Over"}},
  {"slug":"el-callao","banner":"images/banners/el-callao.png","color":"var(--coral)","region":{"es":"Gran Caribe","en":"Greater Caribbean","de":"Großkaribik"},"place":{"es":"El Callao","en":"El Callao","de":"El Callao"},"country":{"es":"Venezuela","en":"Venezuela","de":"Venezuela"},"dates":{"es":"6 — 9 feb 2027; temporada de enero a marzo","en":"Feb 6 — 9, 2027; season from January to March","de":"6.–9. Feb. 2027; Saison von Januar bis März"},"location":{"es":"El Callao, estado Bolívar, Venezuela, América del Sur","en":"El Callao, Bolívar State, Venezuela, South America","de":"El Callao, Bundesstaat Bolívar, Venezuela, Südamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Siglo XIX, con la fiebre del oro y la llegada de mineros antillanos","en":"19th century, with the gold rush and the arrival of Antillean miners","de":"19. Jahrhundert, mit dem Goldrausch und der Ankunft antillanischer Bergleute"},"intro":{"es":"En este pueblo minero del sur de Venezuela, los inmigrantes llegados de Trinidad, Granada, Santa Lucía y las Antillas francesas trajeron su patois, su cocina y el calipso. Su carnaval, con madamas, medio-pintos, mineros y diablos, recorre las calles al ritmo del calipso callaoense, cantado en inglés, patois y español.","en":"In this mining town in southern Venezuela, immigrants from Trinidad, Grenada, Saint Lucia and the French Antilles brought their patois, their cuisine and calypso. Its carnival, with madamas, medio-pintos, miners and devils, moves through the streets to the rhythm of Callao calypso, sung in English, patois and Spanish.","de":"In dieser Bergbaustadt im Süden Venezuelas brachten Einwanderer aus Trinidad, Grenada, St. Lucia und den Französischen Antillen ihr Patois, ihre Küche und den Calypso mit. Ihr Karneval mit Madamas, Medio-Pintos, Bergleuten und Teufeln zieht im Rhythmus des Calypso callaoense durch die Straßen, gesungen auf Englisch, Patois und Spanisch."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Carnaval de El Callao, Lista Representativa del Patrimonio Cultural Inmaterial, UNESCO (2016)","en":"Carnival of El Callao, Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage, UNESCO (2016)","de":"Karneval von El Callao, Repräsentative Liste des immateriellen Kulturerbes, UNESCO (2016)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Madamas, medio-pintos, mineros, diablos, mamarrachos","en":"Madamas, medio-pintos, miners, devils, mamarrachos","de":"Madamas, Medio-Pintos, Bergleute, Teufel, Mamarrachos"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Calipso callaoense, steelpan, bombo, cuatro","en":"Callao calypso, steelpan, bass drum, cuatro","de":"Calypso callaoense, Steelpan, Basstrommel, Cuatro"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfiles de comparsas, presentación de las madamas, conciertos de calipso","en":"Comparsa parades, presentation of the madamas, calypso concerts","de":"Umzüge der Comparsas, Auftritt der Madamas, Calypso-Konzerte"}}],"related":[{"type":{"es":"Especial","en":"Special","de":"Spezial"},"href":"especial-calypso.html","img":"images/calypso-card.png","title":{"es":"La ruta del calipso","en":"The Calypso Route","de":"Die Route des Calypso"},"deck":{"es":"Historia, monarcas, géneros hermanos y rutas de migración, en ocho capítulos.","en":"History, monarchs, sister genres and migration routes, in eight chapters.","de":"Geschichte, Monarchen, verwandte Genres und Migrationsrouten in acht Kapiteln."}}]},
  {"slug":"veracruz","banner":"images/banners/veracruz.png","color":"var(--coral)","region":{"es":"Gran Caribe","en":"Greater Caribbean","de":"Großkaribik"},"place":{"es":"Veracruz","en":"Veracruz","de":"Veracruz"},"country":{"es":"Gran Caribe","en":"Greater Caribbean","de":"Großkaribik"},"dates":{"es":"Feb 2027 (semana previa al Miércoles de Ceniza; por confirmar)","en":"Feb 2027 (week before Ash Wednesday; tbc)","de":"Feb. 2027 (Woche vor Aschermittwoch; noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Veracruz, Veracruz, México, América del Norte","en":"Veracruz, Veracruz, Mexico, North America","de":"Veracruz, Veracruz, Mexiko, Nordamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Bailes de máscaras del siglo XIX; desfiles modernos desde 1925","en":"19th-century masked balls; modern parades since 1925","de":"Maskenbälle des 19. Jh.; moderne Umzüge seit 1925"},"intro":{"es":"El puerto de Veracruz celebra el que se anuncia como «el carnaval más alegre del mundo». Abre con la quema del mal humor y sigue con desfiles de carros alegóricos y comparsas por el malecón, al ritmo de la música jarocha y tropical, hasta el entierro de Juan Carnaval.","en":"The port of Veracruz celebrates what it bills as “the happiest carnival in the world”. It opens with the burning of bad mood and continues with float and comparsa parades along the malecón, to jarocho and tropical music, until the burial of Juan Carnaval.","de":"Die Hafenstadt Veracruz feiert den nach eigenen Worten „fröhlichsten Karneval der Welt“. Er beginnt mit der Verbrennung der schlechten Laune und setzt sich mit Wagen- und Comparsa-Umzügen am Malecón fort, zu Jarocho- und Tropenmusik, bis zum Begräbnis von Juan Carnaval."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Rey Feo, reina del carnaval, Juan Carnaval, comparsas","en":"Rey Feo, carnival queen, Juan Carnaval, comparsas","de":"Rey Feo, Karnevalskönigin, Juan Carnaval, Comparsas"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Son jarocho, danzón, salsa, cumbia","en":"Son jarocho, danzón, salsa, cumbia","de":"Son jarocho, Danzón, Salsa, Cumbia"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Quema del mal humor, desfiles por el malecón, entierro de Juan Carnaval","en":"Burning of bad mood, malecón parades, burial of Juan Carnaval","de":"Verbrennung der schlechten Laune, Umzüge am Malecón, Begräbnis von Juan Carnaval"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"mazatlan","banner":"images/banners/mazatlan.png","color":"oklch(0.58 0.1 95)","region":{"es":"Centroamérica","en":"Central America","de":"Mittelamerika"},"place":{"es":"Mazatlán","en":"Mazatlán","de":"Mazatlán"},"country":{"es":"Centroamérica","en":"Central America","de":"Mittelamerika"},"dates":{"es":"4 — 9 feb 2027 (aprox.)","en":"Feb 4 — 9, 2027 (approx.)","de":"4.–9. Feb. 2027 (ca.)"},"location":{"es":"Mazatlán, Sinaloa, México, América del Norte","en":"Mazatlán, Sinaloa, Mexico, North America","de":"Mazatlán, Sinaloa, Mexiko, Nordamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Carnaval organizado desde 1898","en":"Organised carnival since 1898","de":"Organisierter Karneval seit 1898"},"intro":{"es":"Mazatlán celebra uno de los carnavales más antiguos de México, frente al Pacífico. Sus desfiles recorren el malecón con carros alegóricos y bandas sinaloenses, y el Combate Naval recrea con fuegos artificiales la defensa del puerto ante la flota francesa en 1864.","en":"Mazatlán holds one of Mexico's oldest carnivals, facing the Pacific. Its parades run along the malecón with floats and Sinaloan brass bands, and the Combate Naval re-enacts with fireworks the port's defence against the French fleet in 1864.","de":"Mazatlán feiert am Pazifik einen der ältesten Karnevale Mexikos. Die Umzüge ziehen mit Wagen und Banda-sinaloense-Kapellen über den Malecón, und das Combate Naval stellt mit Feuerwerk die Verteidigung des Hafens gegen die französische Flotte 1864 nach."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Rey de la Alegría, reina del carnaval, carros alegóricos","en":"King of Joy, carnival queen, floats","de":"König der Freude, Karnevalskönigin, Wagen"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Banda sinaloense, tambora","en":"Banda sinaloense, tambora","de":"Banda sinaloense, Tambora"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Coronaciones, desfiles por el malecón, Combate Naval","en":"Coronations, malecón parades, Combate Naval","de":"Krönungen, Umzüge am Malecón, Combate Naval"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"cajamarca","banner":"images/banners/cajamarca.png","color":"var(--purple)","region":{"es":"Andes","en":"Andes","de":"Anden"},"place":{"es":"Cajamarca","en":"Cajamarca","de":"Cajamarca"},"country":{"es":"Perú","en":"Peru","de":"Peru"},"dates":{"es":"Feb 2027 (por confirmar)","en":"Feb 2027 (tbc)","de":"Feb. 2027 (noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Cajamarca, Departamento de Cajamarca, Perú, América del Sur","en":"Cajamarca, Cajamarca Region, Peru, South America","de":"Cajamarca, Region Cajamarca, Peru, Südamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Raíces coloniales y andinas","en":"Colonial and Andean roots","de":"Koloniale und andine Wurzeln"},"intro":{"es":"Considerada la capital del carnaval peruano, Cajamarca vive su fiesta con juegos de agua, pintura y talco, coplas cantadas por las patrullas y comparsas que recorren la ciudad. El rey de la fiesta es Ño Carnavalón, que llega al inicio y muere al final, leyendo su testamento.","en":"Considered the capital of Peruvian carnival, Cajamarca lives its festival with water, paint and talc games, coplas sung by the patrullas and comparsas roaming the city. The king of the festival is Ño Carnavalón, who arrives at the start and dies at the end, reading his testament.","de":"Cajamarca gilt als Hauptstadt des peruanischen Karnevals und feiert mit Wasser-, Farb- und Puderspielen, von den Patrullas gesungenen Coplas und Comparsas, die durch die Stadt ziehen. König des Festes ist Ño Carnavalón, der zu Beginn ankommt und am Ende stirbt und sein Testament verliest."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Ño Carnavalón, patrullas, comparsas, reina del carnaval","en":"Ño Carnavalón, patrullas, comparsas, carnival queen","de":"Ño Carnavalón, Patrullas, Comparsas, Karnevalskönigin"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Coplas de carnaval, cashua, bandas","en":"Carnival coplas, cashua, bands","de":"Karnevals-Coplas, Cashua, Kapellen"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Llegada de Ño Carnavalón, corso, unsha, lectura del testamento","en":"Arrival of Ño Carnavalón, corso, unsha, reading of the testament","de":"Ankunft von Ño Carnavalón, Corso, Unsha, Verlesung des Testaments"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"encarnacion","banner":"images/banners/encarnacion.png","color":"var(--blue)","region":{"es":"Río de la Plata","en":"Río de la Plata","de":"Río de la Plata"},"place":{"es":"Encarnación","en":"Encarnación","de":"Encarnación"},"country":{"es":"Paraguay","en":"Paraguay","de":"Paraguay"},"dates":{"es":"Fines de semana de ene — feb 2027","en":"Weekends Jan — Feb 2027","de":"Wochenenden Jan. – Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Encarnación, Itapúa, Paraguay, América del Sur","en":"Encarnación, Itapúa, Paraguay, South America","de":"Encarnación, Itapúa, Paraguay, Südamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Corsos desde comienzos del siglo XX","en":"Corsos since the early 20th century","de":"Corsos seit Anfang des 20. Jh."},"intro":{"es":"A orillas del río Paraná, Encarnación se presenta como la capital del carnaval paraguayo. Durante las noches de verano, las comparsas desfilan por el sambódromo de la costanera con plumas, carrozas y batucadas, en una fiesta muy cercana a los carnavales del litoral argentino y del sur de Brasil.","en":"On the banks of the Paraná river, Encarnación presents itself as the capital of Paraguayan carnival. On summer nights, comparsas parade through the riverside sambadrome with feathers, floats and batucadas, in a festival close to the carnivals of Argentina's Litoral and southern Brazil.","de":"Am Ufer des Paraná versteht sich Encarnación als Hauptstadt des paraguayischen Karnevals. In Sommernächten ziehen Comparsas mit Federn, Wagen und Batucadas durch das Sambódromo an der Uferpromenade – ein Fest, das den Karnevalen des argentinischen Litoral und Südbrasiliens nahesteht."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Comparsas, reinas, batucadas","en":"Comparsas, queens, batucadas","de":"Comparsas, Königinnen, Batucadas"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Batucada, samba","en":"Batucada, samba","de":"Batucada, Samba"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Noches de desfile en el sambódromo de la costanera","en":"Parade nights at the riverside sambadrome","de":"Paradenächte im Sambódromo an der Uferpromenade"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"olinda","banner":"images/banners/olinda.png","color":"var(--amber)","region":{"es":"Brasil","en":"Brazil","de":"Brasilien"},"place":{"es":"Olinda","en":"Olinda","de":"Olinda"},"country":{"es":"Brasil","en":"Brazil","de":"Brasilien"},"dates":{"es":"6 — 9 feb 2027","en":"Feb 6 — 9, 2027","de":"6.–9. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Olinda, Pernambuco, Brasil, América del Sur","en":"Olinda, Pernambuco, Brazil, South America","de":"Olinda, Pernambuco, Brasilien, Südamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Troças y clubes de frevo desde comienzos del siglo XX; muñecos gigantes desde 1932","en":"Troças and frevo clubs since the early 20th century; giant puppets since 1932","de":"Troças und Frevo-Clubs seit Anfang des 20. Jh.; Riesenpuppen seit 1932"},"intro":{"es":"En las cuestas coloniales de Olinda, vecina de Recife, el carnaval es gratuito y callejero. Lo protagonizan los bonecos gigantes, muñecos de varios metros que bailan entre la multitud, y cientos de troças y blocos que suben y bajan al ritmo del frevo y el maracatu.","en":"On the colonial slopes of Olinda, Recife's neighbour, carnival is free and in the street. Its protagonists are the bonecos gigantes, puppets several metres tall that dance among the crowd, and hundreds of troças and blocos climbing up and down to frevo and maracatu.","de":"An den kolonialen Hängen von Olinda, der Nachbarstadt Recifes, ist der Karneval kostenlos und findet auf der Straße statt. Hauptfiguren sind die Bonecos gigantes, mehrere Meter hohe Puppen, die in der Menge tanzen, und Hunderte Troças und Blocos, die zu Frevo und Maracatu bergauf und bergab ziehen."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Centro histórico de Olinda, Patrimonio de la Humanidad, UNESCO (1982)","en":"Historic Centre of Olinda, World Heritage Site, UNESCO (1982)","de":"Altstadt von Olinda, Welterbe, UNESCO (1982)"},{"es":"Frevo, Lista Representativa del Patrimonio Cultural Inmaterial, UNESCO (2012)","en":"Frevo, Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage, UNESCO (2012)","de":"Frevo, Repräsentative Liste des immateriellen Kulturerbes, UNESCO (2012)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Bonecos gigantes (Homem da Meia-Noite), troças, blocos","en":"Giant puppets (Homem da Meia-Noite), troças, blocos","de":"Riesenpuppen (Homem da Meia-Noite), Troças, Blocos"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Frevo, maracatu, caboclinho","en":"Frevo, maracatu, caboclinho","de":"Frevo, Maracatu, Caboclinho"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Salida del Homem da Meia-Noite, Encuentro de Bonecos Gigantes","en":"Departure of the Homem da Meia-Noite, Giant Puppets Meeting","de":"Auszug des Homem da Meia-Noite, Treffen der Riesenpuppen"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"sao-luis","banner":"images/banners/sao-luis.png","color":"var(--amber)","region":{"es":"Brasil","en":"Brazil","de":"Brasilien"},"place":{"es":"São Luís","en":"São Luís","de":"São Luís"},"country":{"es":"Brasil","en":"Brazil","de":"Brasilien"},"dates":{"es":"6 — 9 feb 2027","en":"Feb 6 — 9, 2027","de":"6.–9. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"São Luís, Maranhão, Brasil, América del Sur","en":"São Luís, Maranhão, Brazil, South America","de":"São Luís, Maranhão, Brasilien, Südamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Carnaval de calle y blocos tradicionales del siglo XX","en":"20th-century street carnival and traditional blocos","de":"Straßenkarneval und traditionelle Blocos des 20. Jh."},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de São Luís combina los blocos tradicionales, con sus trajes de cintas y sus tambores, con la herencia afromaranhense del tambor de crioula. Se vive en las calles del centro histórico colonial y en los circuitos de la ciudad.","en":"São Luís carnival combines the traditional blocos, with their ribbon costumes and drums, with the Afro-Maranhão heritage of tambor de crioula. It is lived in the streets of the colonial historic centre and along the city's circuits.","de":"Der Karneval von São Luís verbindet die traditionellen Blocos mit Bänderkostümen und Trommeln mit dem afro-maranhensischen Erbe des Tambor de crioula. Er findet in den Straßen der kolonialen Altstadt und auf den Routen der Stadt statt."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Centro histórico de São Luís, Patrimonio de la Humanidad, UNESCO (1997)","en":"Historic Centre of São Luís, World Heritage Site, UNESCO (1997)","de":"Altstadt von São Luís, Welterbe, UNESCO (1997)"},{"es":"Tambor de crioula, patrimonio inmaterial de Brasil, IPHAN (2007)","en":"Tambor de crioula, intangible heritage of Brazil, IPHAN (2007)","de":"Tambor de crioula, immaterielles Kulturerbe Brasiliens, IPHAN (2007)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Blocos tradicionales, fofões, tribos de índio","en":"Traditional blocos, fofões, tribos de índio","de":"Traditionelle Blocos, Fofões, Tribos de índio"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Tambor de crioula, samba, marchinhas","en":"Tambor de crioula, samba, marchinhas","de":"Tambor de crioula, Samba, Marchinhas"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfile de blocos tradicionales, carnaval del centro histórico","en":"Parade of traditional blocos, historic-centre carnival","de":"Umzug der traditionellen Blocos, Karneval in der Altstadt"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"niza","banner":"images/banners/niza.png","color":"var(--teal)","region":{"es":"Europa mediterránea","en":"Mediterranean Europe","de":"Mittelmeer-Europa"},"place":{"es":"Niza","en":"Nice","de":"Nizza"},"country":{"es":"Francia","en":"France","de":"Frankreich"},"dates":{"es":"Feb 2027 (dos semanas; por confirmar)","en":"Feb 2027 (two weeks; tbc)","de":"Feb. 2027 (zwei Wochen; noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Niza, Alpes Marítimos, Francia, Europa","en":"Nice, Alpes-Maritimes, France, Europe","de":"Nizza, Alpes-Maritimes, Frankreich, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Primera mención en 1294; forma moderna desde 1873","en":"First mentioned in 1294; modern form since 1873","de":"Erste Erwähnung 1294; moderne Form seit 1873"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Niza es uno de los grandes carnavales de carrozas de Europa. Sus figuras de papel maché, elaboradas por familias de carristas, desfilan por la Place Masséna en torno a un tema anual, y las batallas de flores reparten mimosas y claveles a lo largo del Paseo de los Ingleses.","en":"The Nice Carnival is one of Europe's great float carnivals. Its papier-mâché figures, made by families of float builders, parade through Place Masséna around an annual theme, and the flower battles hand out mimosas and carnations along the Promenade des Anglais.","de":"Der Karneval von Nizza ist einer der großen Wagenkarnevale Europas. Seine von Wagenbauerfamilien gefertigten Pappmaché-Figuren ziehen zu einem Jahresthema über die Place Masséna, und die Blumenschlachten verteilen Mimosen und Nelken entlang der Promenade des Anglais."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Rey del Carnaval, grosses têtes, carristas","en":"King of Carnival, grosses têtes, float builders","de":"Karnevalskönig, Grosses têtes, Wagenbauer"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Bandas y compañías de calle","en":"Bands and street companies","de":"Kapellen und Straßenkompanien"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Corsos carnavalescos, batallas de flores, quema del Rey","en":"Carnival corsos, flower battles, burning of the King","de":"Karnevalskorsos, Blumenschlachten, Verbrennung des Königs"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"tenerife","banner":"images/banners/tenerife.png","color":"var(--teal)","region":{"es":"Europa mediterránea","en":"Mediterranean Europe","de":"Mittelmeer-Europa"},"place":{"es":"Santa Cruz de Tenerife","en":"Santa Cruz de Tenerife","de":"Santa Cruz de Tenerife"},"country":{"es":"España","en":"Spain","de":"Spanien"},"dates":{"es":"Feb 2027 (por confirmar)","en":"Feb 2027 (tbc)","de":"Feb. 2027 (noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Santa Cruz de Tenerife, Canarias, España, Europa","en":"Santa Cruz de Tenerife, Canary Islands, Spain, Europe","de":"Santa Cruz de Tenerife, Kanarische Inseln, Spanien, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Fiestas de máscaras desde el siglo XVIII; «Fiestas de Invierno» durante el franquismo","en":"Masked festivities since the 18th century; “Winter Festivities” under Franco","de":"Maskenfeste seit dem 18. Jh.; „Winterfeste“ unter Franco"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Santa Cruz es famoso por la gala de elección de la Reina, con trajes monumentales, y por sus concursos de murgas, comparsas y rondallas. En 1987, un concierto de Celia Cruz reunió a una multitud récord en la calle.","en":"The Santa Cruz carnival is famous for its Queen election gala, with monumental costumes, and for its murga, comparsa and rondalla contests. In 1987, a Celia Cruz concert gathered a record crowd in the street.","de":"Der Karneval von Santa Cruz ist berühmt für die Gala zur Wahl der Königin mit monumentalen Kostümen und für seine Wettbewerbe der Murgas, Comparsas und Rondallas. 1987 versammelte ein Konzert von Celia Cruz eine Rekordmenge auf der Straße."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Fiesta de Interés Turístico Internacional (1980)","en":"Fiesta of International Tourist Interest (1980)","de":"Fest von internationalem touristischem Interesse (1980)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Reina del carnaval, murgas, comparsas, rondallas","en":"Carnival queen, murgas, comparsas, rondallas","de":"Karnevalskönigin, Murgas, Comparsas, Rondallas"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Murga canaria, salsa, ritmos latinos","en":"Canarian murga, salsa, Latin rhythms","de":"Kanarische Murga, Salsa, lateinamerikanische Rhythmen"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Gala de elección de la Reina, Coso, entierro de la sardina","en":"Queen election gala, Coso parade, burial of the sardine","de":"Gala zur Königinnenwahl, Coso, Begräbnis der Sardine"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"las-palmas","banner":"images/banners/las-palmas.png","color":"var(--teal)","region":{"es":"Europa mediterránea","en":"Mediterranean Europe","de":"Mittelmeer-Europa"},"place":{"es":"Las Palmas de Gran Canaria","en":"Las Palmas de Gran Canaria","de":"Las Palmas de Gran Canaria"},"country":{"es":"España","en":"Spain","de":"Spanien"},"dates":{"es":"Feb — mar 2027 (por confirmar)","en":"Feb — Mar 2027 (tbc)","de":"Feb. – März 2027 (noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Las Palmas de Gran Canaria, Canarias, España, Europa","en":"Las Palmas de Gran Canaria, Canary Islands, Spain, Europe","de":"Las Palmas de Gran Canaria, Kanarische Inseln, Spanien, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Carnaval documentado desde el siglo XVI; recuperado en 1976","en":"Carnival documented since the 16th century; revived in 1976","de":"Karneval seit dem 16. Jh. belegt; 1976 wiederbelebt"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Las Palmas, recuperado tras la dictadura, gira en torno al parque Santa Catalina. Junto a la Reina y las murgas, su gala Drag Queen se ha convertido en símbolo de diversidad y espectáculo, y la gran cabalgata llena la ciudad antes del entierro de la sardina.","en":"The Las Palmas carnival, revived after the dictatorship, revolves around Santa Catalina park. Alongside the Queen and the murgas, its Drag Queen gala has become a symbol of diversity and spectacle, and the grand cavalcade fills the city before the burial of the sardine.","de":"Der nach der Diktatur wiederbelebte Karneval von Las Palmas dreht sich um den Parque Santa Catalina. Neben Königin und Murgas ist seine Drag-Queen-Gala zum Symbol für Vielfalt und Spektakel geworden, und der große Umzug füllt die Stadt vor dem Begräbnis der Sardine."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Drag queens, reina del carnaval, murgas, comparsas","en":"Drag queens, carnival queen, murgas, comparsas","de":"Drag Queens, Karnevalskönigin, Murgas, Comparsas"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Murga canaria, ritmos latinos","en":"Canarian murga, Latin rhythms","de":"Kanarische Murga, lateinamerikanische Rhythmen"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Gala Drag Queen, gran cabalgata, entierro de la sardina","en":"Drag Queen gala, grand cavalcade, burial of the sardine","de":"Drag-Queen-Gala, großer Umzug, Begräbnis der Sardine"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"rottweil","banner":"images/banners/rottweil.png","color":"var(--green)","region":{"es":"Europa central","en":"Central Europe","de":"Mitteleuropa"},"place":{"es":"Rottweil","en":"Rottweil","de":"Rottweil"},"country":{"es":"Alemania","en":"Germany","de":"Deutschland"},"dates":{"es":"8 — 9 feb 2027","en":"Feb 8 — 9, 2027","de":"8.–9. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Rottweil, Baden-Wurtemberg, Alemania, Europa","en":"Rottweil, Baden-Württemberg, Germany, Europe","de":"Rottweil, Baden-Württemberg, Deutschland, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Fastnacht medieval; Narrensprung documentado desde el siglo XVIII","en":"Medieval Fastnacht; Narrensprung documented since the 18th century","de":"Mittelalterliche Fastnacht; Narrensprung seit dem 18. Jh. belegt"},"intro":{"es":"En Rottweil, la Fastnacht suabo-alemánica se vive con máscaras de madera talladas que pasan de generación en generación. El lunes y el martes, a las ocho de la mañana, miles de bufones salen por la Puerta Negra en el Narrensprung, saltando al son de la banda y haciendo sonar sus cascabeles.","en":"In Rottweil, the Swabian-Alemannic Fastnacht is lived with carved wooden masks passed down through generations. On Monday and Tuesday at eight in the morning, thousands of fools pour through the Black Gate in the Narrensprung, leaping to the band and ringing their bells.","de":"In Rottweil wird die schwäbisch-alemannische Fastnacht mit geschnitzten Holzmasken gefeiert, die über Generationen weitergegeben werden. Am Montag und Dienstag um acht Uhr morgens springen Tausende Narren beim Narrensprung durch das Schwarze Tor, zur Musik der Kapelle und mit klingenden Schellen."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Fastnacht suabo-alemánica, inventario nacional del patrimonio inmaterial de Alemania (2014)","en":"Swabian-Alemannic Fastnacht, German national inventory of intangible heritage (2014)","de":"Schwäbisch-alemannische Fastnacht, Bundesweites Verzeichnis des immateriellen Kulturerbes (2014)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Federahannes, Schantle, Biß, Gschell","en":"Federahannes, Schantle, Biß, Gschell","de":"Federahannes, Schantle, Biß, Gschell"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Narrenmarsch de la banda municipal","en":"The civic band's Narrenmarsch","de":"Narrenmarsch der Stadtkapelle"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Narrensprung, Aufsagen (versos satíricos), quema de la Fastnacht","en":"Narrensprung, Aufsagen (satirical verses), burning of the Fastnacht","de":"Narrensprung, Aufsagen, Fastnachtsverbrennung"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Fastnacht suabo-alemánica","en":"Swabian-Alemannic Fastnacht","de":"Schwäbisch-alemannische Fastnacht"}},
  {"slug":"lucerna","banner":"images/banners/lucerna.png","color":"var(--green)","region":{"es":"Europa central","en":"Central Europe","de":"Mitteleuropa"},"place":{"es":"Lucerna","en":"Lucerne","de":"Luzern"},"country":{"es":"Suiza","en":"Switzerland","de":"Schweiz"},"dates":{"es":"4 — 9 feb 2027","en":"Feb 4 — 9, 2027","de":"4.–9. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Lucerna, Cantón de Lucerna, Suiza, Europa","en":"Lucerne, Canton of Lucerne, Switzerland, Europe","de":"Luzern, Kanton Luzern, Schweiz, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Fasnacht documentada desde la Edad Media; figura de Fritschi desde el siglo XV","en":"Fasnacht documented since the Middle Ages; Fritschi figure since the 15th century","de":"Fasnacht seit dem Mittelalter belegt; Fritschi-Figur seit dem 15. Jh."},"intro":{"es":"La Fasnacht de Lucerna estalla a las cinco de la mañana del Jueves Lardero con el Urknall, una explosión que da la señal de salida. Durante seis días, las Guggenmusigen recorren el casco antiguo tocando metales desafinados a propósito, con máscaras y trajes hechos a mano.","en":"The Lucerne Fasnacht bursts open at five in the morning on Schmutziger Donnerstag with the Urknall, an explosion that gives the starting signal. For six days, the Guggenmusigen roam the old town playing deliberately out-of-tune brass, in handmade masks and costumes.","de":"Die Luzerner Fasnacht bricht am Schmutzigen Donnerstag um fünf Uhr morgens mit dem Urknall los. Sechs Tage lang ziehen die Guggenmusigen mit absichtlich schräg gespielten Blechinstrumenten, handgemachten Masken und Kostümen durch die Altstadt."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Lista de tradiciones vivas de Suiza (2011)","en":"List of Living Traditions in Switzerland (2011)","de":"Liste der lebendigen Traditionen der Schweiz (2011)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Fritschi, Guggenmusigen, Grende (máscaras)","en":"Fritschi, Guggenmusigen, Grende (masks)","de":"Fritschi, Guggenmusigen, Grende"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Guggenmusik","en":"Guggenmusik","de":"Guggenmusik"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Urknall, Fritschi-Umzug, Monstercorso","en":"Urknall, Fritschi-Umzug, Monstercorso","de":"Urknall, Fritschi-Umzug, Monstercorso"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Luzerner Fasnacht","en":"Luzerner Fasnacht","de":"Luzerner Fasnacht"}},
  {"slug":"aalst","banner":"images/banners/aalst.png","color":"var(--green)","region":{"es":"Europa central","en":"Central Europe","de":"Mitteleuropa"},"place":{"es":"Aalst","en":"Aalst","de":"Aalst"},"country":{"es":"Bélgica","en":"Belgium","de":"Belgien"},"dates":{"es":"7 — 9 feb 2027","en":"Feb 7 — 9, 2027","de":"7.–9. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Aalst, Flandes Oriental, Bélgica, Europa","en":"Aalst, East Flanders, Belgium, Europe","de":"Aalst, Ostflandern, Belgien, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Fiestas documentadas desde 1432; desfile moderno desde 1923","en":"Festivities documented since 1432; modern parade since 1923","de":"Feste seit 1432 belegt; moderner Umzug seit 1923"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Aalst es célebre por su sátira sin límites: el domingo desfilan las carrozas de los grupos, el lunes se lanzan cebollas desde el ayuntamiento y el martes los Voil Jeanetten, hombres vestidos de mujer, toman las calles. En 2019 fue retirado de la lista de la UNESCO por carrozas de contenido antisemita.","en":"The Aalst carnival is famous for its limitless satire: on Sunday the groups' floats parade, on Monday onions are thrown from the town hall and on Tuesday the Voil Jeanetten, men dressed as women, take to the streets. In 2019 it was removed from the UNESCO list over floats with antisemitic content.","de":"Der Karneval von Aalst ist für seine grenzenlose Satire bekannt: Am Sonntag ziehen die Wagen der Gruppen, am Montag werden Zwiebeln vom Rathaus geworfen, und am Dienstag erobern die Voil Jeanetten, als Frauen verkleidete Männer, die Straßen. 2019 wurde er wegen antisemitischer Wagen von der UNESCO-Liste gestrichen."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Inscrito en la Lista Representativa de la UNESCO en 2010; retirado en 2019","en":"Inscribed on the UNESCO Representative List in 2010; removed in 2019","de":"2010 in die Repräsentative Liste der UNESCO aufgenommen; 2019 gestrichen"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Prins Carnaval, Voil Jeanetten, Ajuinen","en":"Prins Carnaval, Voil Jeanetten, Ajuinen","de":"Prins Carnaval, Voil Jeanetten, Ajuinen"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Canciones de carnaval en neerlandés, bandas","en":"Carnival songs in Dutch, brass bands","de":"Karnevalslieder auf Niederländisch, Kapellen"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfile del domingo, lanzamiento de cebollas, Voil Jeanetten, quema de la Pop","en":"Sunday parade, onion throw, Voil Jeanetten, burning of the Pop","de":"Sonntagsumzug, Zwiebelwurf, Voil Jeanetten, Verbrennung der Pop"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"patras","banner":"images/banners/patras.png","color":"var(--teal)","region":{"es":"Europa mediterránea","en":"Mediterranean Europe","de":"Mittelmeer-Europa"},"place":{"es":"Patras","en":"Patras","de":"Patras"},"country":{"es":"Grecia","en":"Greece","de":"Griechenland"},"dates":{"es":"Ene — mar 2027; gran desfile 14 mar","en":"Jan — Mar 2027; grand parade Mar 14","de":"Jan. – März 2027; großer Umzug 14. März"},"location":{"es":"Patras, Grecia Occidental, Grecia, Europa","en":"Patras, Western Greece, Greece, Europe","de":"Patras, Westgriechenland, Griechenland, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Bailes de carnaval desde 1829","en":"Carnival balls since 1829","de":"Karnevalsbälle seit 1829"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Patras, el mayor de Grecia, sigue el calendario ortodoxo y se extiende durante semanas hasta el domingo anterior al Lunes Limpio. Miles de participantes desfilan en grupos disfrazados, y la fiesta termina en el puerto con la quema del Rey Carnaval.","en":"The Patras Carnival, the largest in Greece, follows the Orthodox calendar and stretches over weeks until the Sunday before Clean Monday. Thousands of participants parade in costumed groups, and the festival ends at the harbour with the burning of the Carnival King.","de":"Der Karneval von Patras, der größte Griechenlands, folgt dem orthodoxen Kalender und erstreckt sich über Wochen bis zum Sonntag vor dem Reinen Montag. Tausende ziehen in verkleideten Gruppen durch die Stadt, und das Fest endet am Hafen mit der Verbrennung des Karnevalskönigs."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Rey Carnaval, grupos de disfraces, carrozas","en":"Carnival King, costume groups, floats","de":"Karnevalskönig, Kostümgruppen, Wagen"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Bandas y música popular griega","en":"Bands and Greek popular music","de":"Kapellen und griechische Volksmusik"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Búsqueda del tesoro, desfile infantil, gran desfile, quema del Rey","en":"Treasure hunt, children's parade, grand parade, burning of the King","de":"Schatzsuche, Kinderumzug, großer Umzug, Verbrennung des Königs"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"rijeka","banner":"images/banners/rijeka.png","color":"var(--teal)","region":{"es":"Europa mediterránea","en":"Mediterranean Europe","de":"Mittelmeer-Europa"},"place":{"es":"Rijeka","en":"Rijeka","de":"Rijeka"},"country":{"es":"Croacia","en":"Croatia","de":"Kroatien"},"dates":{"es":"Ene — feb 2027; gran desfile 7 feb","en":"Jan — Feb 2027; grand parade Feb 7","de":"Jan. – Feb. 2027; großer Umzug 7. Feb."},"location":{"es":"Rijeka, Primorje-Gorski Kotar, Croacia, Europa","en":"Rijeka, Primorje-Gorski Kotar, Croatia, Europe","de":"Rijeka, Primorje-Gorski Kotar, Kroatien, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Zvončari de tradición rural; carnaval urbano moderno desde 1982","en":"Rural zvončari tradition; modern urban carnival since 1982","de":"Ländliche Zvončari-Tradition; moderner Stadtkarneval seit 1982"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Rijeka une un gran desfile urbano con la tradición de los zvončari, hombres de los pueblos de los alrededores que, cubiertos con pieles de oveja y máscaras de animales, hacen sonar enormes cencerros para espantar a los malos espíritus del invierno.","en":"The Rijeka Carnival combines a great urban parade with the tradition of the zvončari, men from the surrounding villages who, covered in sheepskins and animal masks, ring huge bells to drive away the evil spirits of winter.","de":"Der Karneval von Rijeka verbindet einen großen Stadtumzug mit der Tradition der Zvončari, Männer aus den umliegenden Dörfern, die mit Schaffellen und Tiermasken riesige Glocken läuten, um die bösen Geister des Winters zu vertreiben."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Cortejo anual de los zvončari de la región de Kastav, Lista Representativa del Patrimonio Cultural Inmaterial, UNESCO (2009)","en":"Annual carnival bell ringers' pageant from the Kastav area, Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage, UNESCO (2009)","de":"Jährlicher Umzug der Glockenläufer aus der Region Kastav, Repräsentative Liste des immateriellen Kulturerbes, UNESCO (2009)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Zvončari, reina del carnaval, Meštar Toni","en":"Zvončari, carnival queen, Meštar Toni","de":"Zvončari, Karnevalskönigin, Meštar Toni"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Cencerros, bandas","en":"Bells, bands","de":"Glocken, Kapellen"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Entrega de las llaves de la ciudad, gran desfile internacional","en":"Handing over of the city keys, grand international parade","de":"Übergabe der Stadtschlüssel, großer internationaler Umzug"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"ptuj","banner":"images/banners/ptuj.png","color":"var(--green)","region":{"es":"Europa central","en":"Central Europe","de":"Mitteleuropa"},"place":{"es":"Ptuj","en":"Ptuj","de":"Ptuj"},"country":{"es":"Eslovenia","en":"Slovenia","de":"Slowenien"},"dates":{"es":"Ene — feb 2027 (hasta el 10 feb)","en":"Jan — Feb 2027 (until Feb 10)","de":"Jan. – Feb. 2027 (bis 10. Feb.)"},"location":{"es":"Ptuj, Baja Estiria, Eslovenia, Europa","en":"Ptuj, Lower Styria, Slovenia, Europe","de":"Ptuj, Untersteiermark, Slowenien, Europa"},"origin":{"es":"Ritual rural de los kurenti; festival urbano desde 1960","en":"Rural kurenti ritual; urban festival since 1960","de":"Ländliches Kurenti-Ritual; Stadtfest seit 1960"},"intro":{"es":"En el Kurentovanje, los kurenti, figuras cubiertas de piel de oveja, con máscaras de cuernos, lengua roja y cencerros en la cintura, recorren las casas y las calles de Ptuj para ahuyentar el invierno y traer la primavera y la fertilidad.","en":"In the Kurentovanje, the kurenti —figures covered in sheepskin, with horned masks, red tongues and bells at their waist— go from house to house and through the streets of Ptuj to drive out winter and bring spring and fertility.","de":"Beim Kurentovanje ziehen die Kurenti – in Schaffell gehüllte Gestalten mit gehörnten Masken, roter Zunge und Glocken am Gürtel – von Haus zu Haus und durch die Straßen von Ptuj, um den Winter zu vertreiben und Frühling und Fruchtbarkeit zu bringen."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Rondas de los kurenti de puerta en puerta, Lista Representativa del Patrimonio Cultural Inmaterial, UNESCO (2017)","en":"Door-to-door rounds of Kurenti, Representative List of the Intangible Cultural Heritage, UNESCO (2017)","de":"Haus-zu-Haus-Umzüge der Kurenti, Repräsentative Liste des immateriellen Kulturerbes, UNESCO (2017)"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Kurenti, orači (aradores), piceki","en":"Kurenti, orači (ploughmen), piceki","de":"Kurenti, Orači (Pflüger), Piceki"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Cencerros, música popular eslovena","en":"Bells, Slovenian folk music","de":"Glocken, slowenische Volksmusik"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Salida de los kurenti, gran desfile internacional, entierro del carnaval","en":"Kurenti's first outing, grand international parade, burial of carnival","de":"Erster Auftritt der Kurenti, großer internationaler Umzug, Begräbnis des Karnevals"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Kurentovanje","en":"Kurentovanje","de":"Kurentovanje"}},
  {"slug":"mindelo","banner":"images/banners/mindelo.png","color":"oklch(0.64 0.15 60)","region":{"es":"África","en":"Africa","de":"Afrika"},"place":{"es":"Mindelo","en":"Mindelo","de":"Mindelo"},"country":{"es":"Cabo Verde","en":"Cape Verde","de":"Kap Verde"},"dates":{"es":"7 — 9 feb 2027","en":"Feb 7 — 9, 2027","de":"7.–9. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Mindelo, São Vicente, Cabo Verde, África","en":"Mindelo, São Vicente, Cape Verde, Africa","de":"Mindelo, São Vicente, Kap Verde, Afrika"},"origin":{"es":"Carnaval de raíz portuguesa; grupos organizados desde el siglo XX","en":"Carnival of Portuguese roots; organised groups since the 20th century","de":"Karneval portugiesischen Ursprungs; organisierte Gruppen seit dem 20. Jh."},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Mindelo, en la isla de São Vicente, es el mayor de Cabo Verde. Los grupos oficiales preparan durante meses carrozas, trajes y una canción propia, y desfilan el martes por las calles del puerto en una fiesta que mezcla la herencia portuguesa, africana y brasileña.","en":"The Mindelo Carnival, on the island of São Vicente, is the largest in Cape Verde. The official groups spend months preparing floats, costumes and their own song, and parade on Tuesday through the port's streets in a festival that mixes Portuguese, African and Brazilian heritage.","de":"Der Karneval von Mindelo auf der Insel São Vicente ist der größte Kap Verdes. Die offiziellen Gruppen bereiten monatelang Wagen, Kostüme und ein eigenes Lied vor und ziehen am Dienstag durch die Straßen des Hafens – ein Fest, das portugiesisches, afrikanisches und brasilianisches Erbe vermischt."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Grupos oficiales, mandingas, reinas","en":"Official groups, mandingas, queens","de":"Offizielle Gruppen, Mandingas, Königinnen"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Samba, coladeira, funaná, tambores","en":"Samba, coladeira, funaná, drums","de":"Samba, Coladeira, Funaná, Trommeln"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfile de los mandingas, desfile de grupos oficiales el martes","en":"Mandingas parade, official groups' parade on Tuesday","de":"Umzug der Mandingas, Umzug der offiziellen Gruppen am Dienstag"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"luanda","banner":"images/banners/luanda.png","color":"oklch(0.64 0.15 60)","region":{"es":"África","en":"Africa","de":"Afrika"},"place":{"es":"Luanda","en":"Luanda","de":"Luanda"},"country":{"es":"Angola","en":"Angola","de":"Angola"},"dates":{"es":"6 — 9 feb 2027","en":"Feb 6 — 9, 2027","de":"6.–9. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Luanda, Angola, África","en":"Luanda, Angola, Africa","de":"Luanda, Angola, Afrika"},"origin":{"es":"Grupos carnavalescos de los musseques; Carnaval de la Victoria desde 1978","en":"Carnival groups from the musseques; Victory Carnival since 1978","de":"Karnevalsgruppen der Musseques; Siegeskarneval seit 1978"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Luanda nació en los barrios populares, los musseques, y tras la independencia se convirtió en fiesta nacional. Los grupos desfilan por la avenida marginal con coreografías de semba y danzas tradicionales, compitiendo por el título del año.","en":"The Luanda Carnival was born in the working-class neighbourhoods, the musseques, and after independence became a national festival. The groups parade along the waterfront avenue with semba choreographies and traditional dances, competing for the year's title.","de":"Der Karneval von Luanda entstand in den Armenvierteln, den Musseques, und wurde nach der Unabhängigkeit zum Nationalfest. Die Gruppen ziehen mit Semba-Choreografien und traditionellen Tänzen über die Uferstraße und wetteifern um den Jahrestitel."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Grupos carnavalescos (União Mundo da Ilha, entre otros), reyes y reinas","en":"Carnival groups (União Mundo da Ilha, among others), kings and queens","de":"Karnevalsgruppen (u. a. União Mundo da Ilha), Könige und Königinnen"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Semba, kazukuta, varina","en":"Semba, kazukuta, varina","de":"Semba, Kazukuta, Varina"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfile central en la Marginal, carnaval infantil","en":"Central parade on the Marginal, children's carnival","de":"Zentraler Umzug auf der Marginal, Kinderkarneval"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"victoria","banner":"images/banners/victoria.png","color":"oklch(0.64 0.15 60)","region":{"es":"África","en":"Africa","de":"Afrika"},"place":{"es":"Victoria","en":"Victoria","de":"Victoria"},"country":{"es":"Seychelles","en":"Seychelles","de":"Seychellen"},"dates":{"es":"Abr 2027 (por confirmar)","en":"Apr 2027 (tbc)","de":"Apr. 2027 (noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Victoria, Mahé, Seychelles, África","en":"Victoria, Mahé, Seychelles, Africa","de":"Victoria, Mahé, Seychellen, Afrika"},"origin":{"es":"Carnaval Internacional de Victoria desde 2011","en":"Victoria International Carnival since 2011","de":"Internationaler Karneval von Victoria seit 2011"},"intro":{"es":"El Carnaval Internacional de Victoria reúne en la pequeña capital de Seychelles a grupos de carnavales de todo el mundo junto a las comparsas locales. Es una fiesta reciente que combina la cultura criolla del archipiélago con la promoción internacional.","en":"The Victoria International Carnival brings carnival groups from around the world together with local comparsas in the small capital of the Seychelles. It is a recent festival that combines the archipelago's Creole culture with international promotion.","de":"Der Internationale Karneval von Victoria vereint in der kleinen Hauptstadt der Seychellen Karnevalsgruppen aus aller Welt mit lokalen Comparsas. Ein junges Fest, das die kreolische Kultur des Archipels mit internationaler Werbung verbindet."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Grupos invitados internacionales, comparsas criollas","en":"International guest groups, Creole comparsas","de":"Internationale Gastgruppen, kreolische Comparsas"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Moutya, sega, música criolla","en":"Moutya, sega, Creole music","de":"Moutya, Sega, kreolische Musik"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Gran desfile por el centro de Victoria","en":"Grand parade through central Victoria","de":"Großer Umzug durch das Zentrum von Victoria"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Carnaval Internacional de Victoria","en":"Victoria International Carnival","de":"Internationaler Karneval von Victoria"}},
  {"slug":"goa","banner":"images/banners/goa.png","color":"oklch(0.55 0.17 20)","region":{"es":"Asia","en":"Asia","de":"Asien"},"place":{"es":"Panaji","en":"Panaji","de":"Panaji"},"country":{"es":"India","en":"India","de":"Indien"},"dates":{"es":"6 — 9 feb 2027","en":"Feb 6 — 9, 2027","de":"6.–9. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Panaji, Goa, India, Asia","en":"Panaji, Goa, India, Asia","de":"Panaji, Goa, Indien, Asien"},"origin":{"es":"Herencia de la época colonial portuguesa (siglo XVIII)","en":"Legacy of the Portuguese colonial era (18th c.)","de":"Erbe der portugiesischen Kolonialzeit (18. Jh.)"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Goa es una herencia de los cuatro siglos y medio de presencia portuguesa. Durante cuatro días, el Rey Momo toma la ciudad y ordena a sus súbditos divertirse; las carrozas y los grupos de baile desfilan por Panaji, Margao y otras ciudades al ritmo de la música konkani.","en":"The Goa Carnival is a legacy of four and a half centuries of Portuguese presence. For four days, King Momo takes over the city and orders his subjects to have fun; floats and dance groups parade through Panaji, Margao and other towns to Konkani music.","de":"Der Karneval von Goa ist ein Erbe von viereinhalb Jahrhunderten portugiesischer Präsenz. Vier Tage lang übernimmt König Momo die Stadt und befiehlt seinen Untertanen, sich zu vergnügen; Wagen und Tanzgruppen ziehen zu Konkani-Musik durch Panaji, Margao und andere Städte."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Rey Momo, carrozas, grupos de baile","en":"King Momo, floats, dance groups","de":"König Momo, Wagen, Tanzgruppen"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Música konkani, mando, bandas de metales","en":"Konkani music, mando, brass bands","de":"Konkani-Musik, Mando, Blaskapellen"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Decreto del Rey Momo, desfiles de carrozas, baile rojo y negro","en":"King Momo's decree, float parades, red-and-black ball","de":"Dekret von König Momo, Wagenumzüge, Rot-Schwarz-Ball"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Carnaval de Goa","en":"Goa Carnival","de":"Karneval von Goa"}},
  {"slug":"sydney","banner":"images/banners/sydney.png","color":"oklch(0.5 0.1 215)","region":{"es":"Oceanía","en":"Oceania","de":"Ozeanien"},"place":{"es":"Sídney","en":"Sydney","de":"Sydney"},"country":{"es":"Australia","en":"Australia","de":"Australien"},"dates":{"es":"Feb — mar 2027; desfile a finales de febrero (por confirmar)","en":"Feb — Mar 2027; parade in late February (tbc)","de":"Feb. – März 2027; Parade Ende Februar (noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Sídney, Nueva Gales del Sur, Australia, Oceanía","en":"Sydney, New South Wales, Australia, Oceania","de":"Sydney, New South Wales, Australien, Ozeanien"},"origin":{"es":"Manifestación de 1978 (los «78ers»)","en":"1978 protest march (the “78ers”)","de":"Protestmarsch von 1978 (die „78ers“)"},"intro":{"es":"El Mardi Gras de Sídney nació en 1978 como una marcha por los derechos de gais y lesbianas que terminó con detenciones policiales. Hoy es un festival de varias semanas y un desfile nocturno por Oxford Street que une celebración, memoria y reivindicación de la diversidad.","en":"Sydney's Mardi Gras began in 1978 as a march for gay and lesbian rights that ended in police arrests. Today it is a festival lasting several weeks, with a night parade along Oxford Street that combines celebration, memory and a demand for diversity.","de":"Der Mardi Gras von Sydney entstand 1978 als Marsch für die Rechte von Schwulen und Lesben, der mit Festnahmen durch die Polizei endete. Heute ist er ein mehrwöchiges Festival mit einer nächtlichen Parade über die Oxford Street, die Feiern, Erinnerung und das Eintreten für Vielfalt verbindet."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"78ers, Dykes on Bikes, grupos comunitarios","en":"78ers, Dykes on Bikes, community groups","de":"78ers, Dykes on Bikes, Community-Gruppen"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Pop, música electrónica, disco","en":"Pop, electronic music, disco","de":"Pop, elektronische Musik, Disco"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Fair Day, desfile por Oxford Street, fiesta posterior","en":"Fair Day, Oxford Street parade, after party","de":"Fair Day, Parade über die Oxford Street, Party"}}],"related":[],"alias":{"es":"Sydney Gay and Lesbian Mardi Gras","en":"Sydney Gay and Lesbian Mardi Gras","de":"Sydney Gay and Lesbian Mardi Gras"}},
  {"slug":"las-tablas","banner":"images/banners/las-tablas.png","color":"oklch(0.58 0.1 95)","region":{"es":"Centroamérica","en":"Central America","de":"Mittelamerika"},"place":{"es":"Las Tablas","en":"Las Tablas","de":"Las Tablas"},"country":{"es":"Panamá","en":"Panama","de":"Panama"},"dates":{"es":"6 — 10 feb 2027","en":"Feb 6 — 10, 2027","de":"6.–10. Feb. 2027"},"location":{"es":"Las Tablas, Los Santos, Panamá, América Central","en":"Las Tablas, Los Santos, Panama, Central America","de":"Las Tablas, Los Santos, Panama, Mittelamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Primera mitad del siglo XX; rivalidad entre Calle Arriba y Calle Abajo","en":"First half of the 20th century; rivalry between Calle Arriba and Calle Abajo","de":"Erste Hälfte des 20. Jh.; Rivalität zwischen Calle Arriba und Calle Abajo"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Las Tablas, en la península de Azuero, es el más tradicional de Panamá. La ciudad se divide en dos bandos, Calle Arriba y Calle Abajo, que compiten con sus reinas, tunas y carros alegóricos. Por las mañanas, los culecos refrescan a la multitud con agua.","en":"The Las Tablas carnival, on the Azuero peninsula, is Panama's most traditional. The town splits into two sides, Calle Arriba and Calle Abajo, which compete with their queens, tunas and floats. In the mornings, the culecos cool the crowd with water.","de":"Der Karneval von Las Tablas auf der Azuero-Halbinsel ist der traditionellste Panamas. Die Stadt teilt sich in zwei Lager, Calle Arriba und Calle Abajo, die mit ihren Königinnen, Tunas und Wagen gegeneinander antreten. Morgens kühlen die Culecos die Menge mit Wasser ab."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Reinas de Calle Arriba y Calle Abajo, tunas, pollera","en":"Queens of Calle Arriba and Calle Abajo, tunas, pollera","de":"Königinnen von Calle Arriba und Calle Abajo, Tunas, Pollera"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Murgas, tamborito, música típica","en":"Murgas, tamborito, música típica","de":"Murgas, Tamborito, Música típica"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Coronación de las reinas, culecos, desfiles de carros, entierro de la sardina","en":"Coronation of the queens, culecos, float parades, burial of the sardine","de":"Krönung der Königinnen, Culecos, Wagenumzüge, Begräbnis der Sardine"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"limon","banner":"images/banners/limon.png","color":"var(--coral)","region":{"es":"Gran Caribe","en":"Greater Caribbean","de":"Großkaribik"},"place":{"es":"Puerto Limón","en":"Puerto Limón","de":"Puerto Limón"},"country":{"es":"Costa Rica","en":"Costa Rica","de":"Costa Rica"},"dates":{"es":"Oct 2027, semana del 12 de octubre (por confirmar)","en":"Oct 2027, week of 12 October (tbc)","de":"Okt. 2027, Woche um den 12. Oktober (noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Puerto Limón, Limón, Costa Rica, América Central","en":"Puerto Limón, Limón, Costa Rica, Central America","de":"Puerto Limón, Limón, Costa Rica, Mittelamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Iniciado en 1949 por la comunidad afrocaribeña","en":"Started in 1949 by the Afro-Caribbean community","de":"1949 von der afrokaribischen Gemeinschaft begründet"},"intro":{"es":"El carnaval de Limón es la gran fiesta de la comunidad afrocaribeña de Costa Rica, descendiente en buena parte de trabajadores jamaicanos llegados para construir el ferrocarril. En torno al 12 de octubre, las comparsas desfilan con calipso limonense, steelbands y trajes al estilo de Trinidad.","en":"The Limón Carnival is the great festival of Costa Rica's Afro-Caribbean community, largely descended from Jamaican workers who came to build the railway. Around 12 October, comparsas parade with Limón calypso, steelbands and Trinidad-style costumes.","de":"Der Karneval von Limón ist das große Fest der afrokaribischen Gemeinschaft Costa Ricas, die großenteils von jamaikanischen Eisenbahnarbeitern abstammt. Um den 12. Oktober ziehen Comparsas mit Calypso aus Limón, Steelbands und Kostümen im Stil Trinidads durch die Stadt."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Comparsas, steelbands, reina del carnaval","en":"Comparsas, steelbands, carnival queen","de":"Comparsas, Steelbands, Karnevalskönigin"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Calipso limonense, soca, reggae, steelpan","en":"Limón calypso, soca, reggae, steelpan","de":"Calypso aus Limón, Soca, Reggae, Steelpan"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfile de comparsas, Día de las Culturas, festival de calipso","en":"Comparsa parade, Day of Cultures, calypso festival","de":"Comparsa-Umzug, Tag der Kulturen, Calypso-Festival"}}],"related":[{"type":{"es":"Especial","en":"Special","de":"Spezial"},"href":"especial-calypso.html","img":"images/calypso-card.png","title":{"es":"La ruta del calipso","en":"The Calypso Route","de":"Die Route des Calypso"},"deck":{"es":"Historia, monarcas, géneros hermanos y rutas de migración, en ocho capítulos.","en":"History, monarchs, sister genres and migration routes, in eight chapters.","de":"Geschichte, Monarchen, verwandte Genres und Migrationsrouten in acht Kapiteln."}}]},
  {"slug":"mazatenango","banner":"images/banners/mazatenango.png","color":"oklch(0.58 0.1 95)","region":{"es":"Centroamérica","en":"Central America","de":"Mittelamerika"},"place":{"es":"Mazatenango","en":"Mazatenango","de":"Mazatenango"},"country":{"es":"Guatemala","en":"Guatemala","de":"Guatemala"},"dates":{"es":"Feb 2027, en torno al Martes de Carnaval (por confirmar)","en":"Feb 2027, around Shrove Tuesday (tbc)","de":"Feb. 2027, rund um den Fastnachtsdienstag (noch offen)"},"location":{"es":"Mazatenango, Suchitepéquez, Guatemala, América Central","en":"Mazatenango, Suchitepéquez, Guatemala, Central America","de":"Mazatenango, Suchitepéquez, Guatemala, Mittelamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Carnaval organizado desde finales del siglo XIX (por verificar)","en":"Organised carnival since the late 19th century (to be verified)","de":"Organisierter Karneval seit Ende des 19. Jh. (noch zu prüfen)"},"intro":{"es":"En la costa sur de Guatemala, Mazatenango celebra el carnaval más conocido del país. Durante varios días, la ciudad elige a su reina, organiza desfiles de carrozas y comparsas, y llena las calles de cascarones rellenos de confeti y harina.","en":"On Guatemala's southern coast, Mazatenango holds the country's best-known carnival. For several days the town elects its queen, organises float and comparsa parades and fills the streets with cascarones, eggshells filled with confetti and flour.","de":"An der Südküste Guatemalas feiert Mazatenango den bekanntesten Karneval des Landes. Mehrere Tage lang wählt die Stadt ihre Königin, veranstaltet Wagen- und Comparsa-Umzüge und füllt die Straßen mit Cascarones, mit Konfetti und Mehl gefüllten Eierschalen."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Reina del carnaval, comparsas, carrozas","en":"Carnival queen, comparsas, floats","de":"Karnevalskönigin, Comparsas, Wagen"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Marimba, bandas, música tropical","en":"Marimba, brass bands, tropical music","de":"Marimba, Kapellen, Tropenmusik"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Elección de la reina, desfile de carrozas, juego de cascarones","en":"Queen election, float parade, cascarones game","de":"Königinnenwahl, Wagenumzug, Cascarones-Spiel"}}],"related":[]},
  {"slug":"san-miguel","banner":"images/banners/san-miguel.png","color":"oklch(0.58 0.1 95)","region":{"es":"Centroamérica","en":"Central America","de":"Mittelamerika"},"place":{"es":"San Miguel","en":"San Miguel","de":"San Miguel"},"country":{"es":"El Salvador","en":"El Salvador","de":"El Salvador"},"dates":{"es":"27 nov 2027 (último sábado de noviembre)","en":"Nov 27, 2027 (last Saturday of November)","de":"27. Nov. 2027 (letzter Samstag im November)"},"location":{"es":"San Miguel, San Miguel, El Salvador, América Central","en":"San Miguel, San Miguel, El Salvador, Central America","de":"San Miguel, San Miguel, El Salvador, Mittelamerika"},"origin":{"es":"Desde 1958, dentro de las fiestas de la Virgen de la Paz","en":"Since 1958, within the festivities of the Virgen de la Paz","de":"Seit 1958, im Rahmen der Feste der Virgen de la Paz"},"intro":{"es":"El Carnaval de San Miguel cierra las fiestas patronales en honor a la Virgen de la Paz. Es un carnaval fuera de calendario: una sola noche de noviembre en la que la avenida Roosevelt se llena de tarimas con orquestas, desfiles y cientos de miles de personas bailando hasta la madrugada.","en":"The San Miguel Carnival closes the patron saint festivities in honour of the Virgen de la Paz. It is an off-calendar carnival: a single night in November when Avenida Roosevelt fills with stages and bands, parades and hundreds of thousands of people dancing until dawn.","de":"Der Karneval von San Miguel beschließt das Patronatsfest zu Ehren der Virgen de la Paz. Ein Karneval außerhalb des üblichen Kalenders: eine einzige Novembernacht, in der sich die Avenida Roosevelt mit Bühnen und Orchestern, Umzügen und Hunderttausenden Tanzenden bis zum Morgengrauen füllt."},"facts":[{"k":{"es":"Reconocimientos","en":"Recognition","de":"Anerkennungen"},"list":[{"es":"Sin declaratoria oficial conocida","en":"No known official designation","de":"Keine bekannte offizielle Auszeichnung"}]},{"k":{"es":"Figuras","en":"Figures","de":"Figuren"},"v":{"es":"Reina del carnaval, orquestas, carrozas","en":"Carnival queen, orchestras, floats","de":"Karnevalskönigin, Orchester, Wagen"}},{"k":{"es":"Músicas","en":"Music","de":"Musik"},"v":{"es":"Cumbia, salsa, merengue, orquestas tropicales","en":"Cumbia, salsa, merengue, tropical orchestras","de":"Cumbia, Salsa, Merengue, tropische Orchester"}},{"k":{"es":"Momentos","en":"Key events","de":"Höhepunkte"},"v":{"es":"Desfile del carnaval, noche de tarimas en la avenida Roosevelt","en":"Carnival parade, night of stages on Avenida Roosevelt","de":"Karnevalsumzug, Bühnennacht auf der Avenida Roosevelt"}}],"related":[]}
